(115, 2, '2026-08-17 22:51:04', '2026-08-17 22:51:04', '<p>I have always believed chili is less of a strict recipe and more of a personality test. Some people want it smoky, some want it spicy, some insist beans do not belong anywhere near the pot—and everybody is completely certain they are right.</p>\n\n<p>Once, I decided to hold a chili cook-off with friends. The catch? I only allowed myself to compete. 😂 I made three completely different pots, lined them up for everyone to taste, and made my friends choose a winner. Was this wildly unnecessary? Absolutely. Was it a very fun way to spend an evening? Also absolutely.</p>\n\n<p>This cozy, classic version is the kind I come back to when I want dinner to feel generous without being complicated. It is rich, flexible, even better the next day, and perfect for feeding a group—or conducting your own one-person chili competition.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide\"><div style=\"min-height:240px;background:#f6f0e6;border:2px dashed #344c6a;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:30px;text-align:center;color:#344c6a;font-weight:600;\">PHOTO TO ADD: The ingredients gathered on the counter—beans, tomatoes, peppers, spices and all the colorful little bowls.</div><figcaption>A little mise en place makes the whole recipe feel easier.</figcaption></figure>\n\n<h2>Why this chili works</h2>\n<p>The real magic is not one secret ingredient. It is taking a few extra minutes to soften the onions, letting the spices bloom in the pot, and giving everything enough simmering time to become one cozy, deeply flavored dinner.</p>\n\n<h2>Ingredients</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>1 tablespoon olive oil</li><li>1 large yellow onion, diced</li><li>1 bell pepper, diced</li><li>3 cloves garlic, minced</li><li>1½ pounds ground beef or ground turkey</li><li>2 tablespoons chili powder</li><li>2 teaspoons ground cumin</li><li>1 teaspoon smoked paprika</li><li>½ teaspoon dried oregano</li><li>¼ teaspoon cayenne, optional</li><li>2 tablespoons tomato paste</li><li>1 can crushed tomatoes, 28 ounces</li><li>1 can diced tomatoes, 14 to 15 ounces</li><li>1 can kidney beans, drained and rinsed</li><li>1 can black beans, drained and rinsed</li><li>1 to 1½ cups beef or vegetable broth</li><li>1 teaspoon kosher salt, plus more to taste</li><li>Freshly ground black pepper</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Let’s make it</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Build the base.</strong> Warm the oil in a large, heavy pot over medium heat. Add the onion and bell pepper with a small pinch of salt. Cook until softened, about six to eight minutes. Do not rush this part—the softened vegetables are the beginning of all that cozy flavor.</li>\n<li><strong>Brown the meat.</strong> Add the garlic and cook for about thirty seconds. Add the meat and break it into small pieces. Cook until browned, then carefully spoon off excess fat if needed.</li>\n<li><strong>Wake up the spices.</strong> Stir in the chili powder, cumin, smoked paprika, oregano and cayenne. Cook for one minute, stirring, until your kitchen smells incredible.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide\"><div style=\"min-height:240px;background:#f6f0e6;border:2px dashed #344c6a;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:30px;text-align:center;color:#344c6a;font-weight:600;\">PHOTO TO ADD: Tanya stirring the chili after the spices and tomato paste go into the pot.</div><figcaption>This is the moment the kitchen starts smelling like dinner.</figcaption></figure>\n\n<ol start=\"4\">\n<li><strong>Make it rich.</strong> Add the tomato paste and cook for another minute, stirring frequently.</li>\n<li><strong>Bring it together.</strong> Add the crushed tomatoes, diced tomatoes, beans, one cup of broth, salt and several grinds of black pepper.</li>\n<li><strong>Let it simmer.</strong> Bring everything to a gentle simmer. Partially cover and cook for at least thirty minutes, stirring occasionally. Add more broth if the chili becomes thicker than you like.</li>\n<li><strong>Taste it like you mean it.</strong> Adjust the salt and spice. If the tomatoes taste a little sharp, a small pinch of brown sugar will round them out beautifully.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h2>The toppings are half the fun</h2>\n<p>For a crowd, I love setting out a toppings bar and letting everyone build their own bowl. Use shredded cheddar, sour cream, sliced green onions, avocado, cilantro, lime wedges, crushed tortilla chips and hot sauce. Cornbread, a baked potato or a simple green salad turns the pot into a full meal.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide\"><div style=\"min-height:240px;background:#f6f0e6;border:2px dashed #344c6a;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:30px;text-align:center;color:#344c6a;font-weight:600;\">PHOTO TO ADD: A colorful chili toppings bar with cheese, avocado, sour cream, green onions, lime and tortilla chips.</div><figcaption>Put everything in little bowls and suddenly a simple dinner feels like a party.</figcaption></figure>\n\n<h2>Make it your own</h2>\n<p>Add diced jalapeño with the onion if your crowd likes more heat. Stir in corn near the end for sweetness. Replace one can of beans with pinto beans, or skip the meat and add an extra can of beans plus chopped mushrooms for a hearty vegetarian version.</p>\n\n<p>And if you are feeling ambitious, make three variations and invite your friends to judge them. Just remember: when you are the only contestant, you are guaranteed to win—but your friends will still have very strong opinions.</p>\n\n<h2>Storage and the very best leftovers</h2>\n<p>Cool leftovers promptly and refrigerate them in a covered container. Reheat until steaming hot. Chili freezes beautifully in meal-sized portions; leave a little room in the container for expansion. It also tastes even better the next day, which makes it one of my favorite make-ahead dinners.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide\"><div style=\"min-height:260px;background:#f6f0e6;border:2px dashed #344c6a;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:30px;text-align:center;color:#344c6a;font-weight:600;\">PHOTO TO ADD: The finished bowl in a favorite dish, piled with toppings and served with cornbread.</div><figcaption>The cozy bowl that earns a permanent place in the winter rotation.</figcaption></figure>\n\n<h2>Your turn</h2>\n<p>Are you team beans, no beans, extra spicy or keep-it-classic? Leave a comment and tell me what always goes into your perfect pot of chili. And if you host your own cook-off, I fully support entering more than once.</p>', 'The Cozy Chili Recipe You’ll Want to Make All Winter', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '80-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-08-17 22:51:04', '2026-08-17 22:51:04', '', 80, 'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/?p=115', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(116, 2, '2026-08-17 23:10:52', '2026-08-17 23:10:52', '', 'tanya-barrans-seasonal-home-care-checklist', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'tanya-barrans-seasonal-home-care-checklist', '', '', '2026-08-17 23:10:52', '2026-08-17 23:10:52', '', 0, 'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/tanya-barrans-seasonal-home-care-checklist.pdf', 0, 'attachment', 'application/pdf', 0),
(117, 2, '2026-08-17 23:12:31', '2026-08-17 23:12:31', '<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"header\",\"tagName\":\"header\",\"theme\":\"tanya-barrans\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"main\",\"className\":\"tb-article-page\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<main class=\"wp-block-group tb-article-page\">\n\n	<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-article-header\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"920px\"}} -->\n	<header class=\"wp-block-group tb-article-header\">\n		<!-- wp:post-terms {\"term\":\"category\",\"className\":\"tb-journal-label\"} /-->\n		<!-- wp:post-title {\"level\":1,\"className\":\"tb-article-title\",\"fontSize\":\"x-large\"} /-->\n		<!-- wp:post-excerpt {\"moreText\":\"\",\"excerptLength\":32,\"className\":\"tb-article-dek\"} /-->\n		<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-article-meta\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"wrap\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-group tb-article-meta\">\n			<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>From Tanya Barrans</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n			<!-- wp:post-date /-->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:group -->\n	</header>\n	<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n	<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-article-hero\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"1200px\"}} -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-group tb-article-hero\">\n		<!-- wp:post-featured-image {\"aspectRatio\":\"16/9\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\"} /-->\n	</div>\n	<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n	<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-article-body\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"740px\",\"wideSize\":\"1200px\"}} -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-group tb-article-body\">\n		<!-- wp:post-content {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"740px\",\"wideSize\":\"1200px\"}} /-->\n	</div>\n	<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n	<!-- wp:html -->\n	<aside class=\"tb-article-explore\" aria-labelledby=\"article-explore-title\">\n		<div class=\"tb-page-shell\">\n			<p class=\"tb-page-kicker\">Keep exploring</p>\n			<h2 id=\"article-explore-title\">Continue loving where you live.</h2>\n			<div class=\"tb-article-explore__links\">\n				<a href=\"/buy/\"><span>Planning a move</span><strong>Visit the Buyer Hub</strong></a>\n				<a href=\"/sell/\"><span>Thinking about selling</span><strong>Visit the Seller Hub</strong></a>\n			</div>\n		</div>\n	</aside>\n	<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n	<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"tb-newsletter-feature\",\"backgroundColor\":\"base\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"},\"metadata\":{\"patternName\":\"tanya-barrans/newsletter\",\"name\":\"Newsletter Signup\",\"categories\":[\"featured\"]}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull tb-newsletter-feature has-base-background-color has-background\">\n\n	<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-newsletter-feature__image\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-group tb-newsletter-feature__image\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"background-image:url(/wp-content/themes/tanya-barrans/assets/images/lwyl-coffee.jpg)\"></div>\n	<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n	<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-newsletter-feature__content tb-reveal\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-group tb-newsletter-feature__content tb-reveal\">\n		<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"tb-script-accent\"} -->\n		<p class=\"tb-script-accent\">Let’s stay in touch</p>\n		<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n		<!-- wp:heading {\"fontSize\":\"x-large\"} -->\n		<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-x-large-font-size\">Notes worth opening.</h2>\n		<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n		<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"graphite\"} -->\n		<p class=\"has-graphite-color has-text-color\">Useful home ideas, local stories, and honest real estate guidance—delivered with no pressure and no polished filler.</p>\n		<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n		<!-- wp:html -->\n		<form class=\"tb-newsletter-form\" novalidate>\n			<div class=\"tb-newsletter-fields\">\n				<label class=\"tb-sr-only\" for=\"tb-nl-name\">First name</label>\n				<input type=\"text\" id=\"tb-nl-name\" name=\"name\" class=\"tb-newsletter-input\" placeholder=\"First name\" autocomplete=\"given-name\" />\n\n				<label class=\"tb-sr-only\" for=\"tb-nl-email\">Email address</label>\n				<input type=\"email\" id=\"tb-nl-email\" name=\"email\" class=\"tb-newsletter-input\" placeholder=\"Email address\" autocomplete=\"email\" required />\n\n				<div class=\"tb-newsletter-hp\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n					<label for=\"tb-nl-website\">Website</label>\n					<input type=\"text\" id=\"tb-nl-website\" name=\"website\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" />\n				</div>\n\n				<button type=\"submit\" class=\"tb-newsletter-submit\">Subscribe</button>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"tb-newsletter-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n		</form>\n		<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n		<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"tb-newsletter-feature__privacy\"} -->\n		<p class=\"tb-newsletter-feature__privacy\">No spam. Unsubscribe whenever you like.</p>\n		<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n	</div>\n	<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n	<!-- wp:html -->\n	<section class=\"tb-article-author\" aria-labelledby=\"article-author-title\">\n		<div class=\"tb-page-shell tb-article-author__inner\">\n			<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/about-main.jpg\" alt=\"Tanya Barrans, Renton real estate broker\" width=\"934\" height=\"1400\" loading=\"lazy\">\n			<div>\n				<p class=\"tb-page-kicker\">Meet Tanya</p>\n				<h2 id=\"article-author-title\">Local perspective. Honest guidance.</h2>\n				<p>Tanya Barrans helps people make thoughtful decisions about their homes, their neighborhoods, and their next move across Renton and the South Sound.</p>\n				<div class=\"tb-page-actions\">\n					<a class=\"tb-page-button tb-page-button--primary\" href=\"/about/\">More About Tanya</a>\n					<a class=\"tb-text-link\" href=\"/contact/\">Ask Tanya a question <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></a>\n				</div>\n			</div>\n		</div>\n	</section>\n	<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n	<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-article-comments\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"740px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group tb-article-comments\">\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Join the conversation</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Have a tip, a question, or a story of your own? I’d love to hear it.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:comments -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-comments\">\n<!-- wp:comments-title {\"showPostTitle\":false} /-->\n<!-- wp:comment-template -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:avatar {\"size\":48} /--><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:comment-author-name /--><!-- wp:comment-date /--></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:comment-content /-->\n<!-- wp:comment-reply-link /-->\n<!-- /wp:comment-template -->\n<!-- wp:post-comments-form /-->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:comments -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group --> <!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-article-navigation\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"1200px\"}} -->\n	<nav class=\"wp-block-group tb-article-navigation\" aria-label=\"Article navigation\">\n		<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"wrap\",\"justifyContent\":\"space-between\"}} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-group\">\n			<!-- wp:post-navigation-link {\"type\":\"previous\",\"label\":\"Previous story\",\"showTitle\":true,\"linkLabel\":true} /-->\n			<!-- wp:post-navigation-link {\"type\":\"next\",\"label\":\"Next story\",\"showTitle\":true,\"linkLabel\":true} /-->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:group -->\n		<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"tb-journal-back-link\"} --><p class=\"has-text-align-center tb-journal-back-link\"><a href=\"/blog/\">Back to the Journal</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n	</nav>\n	<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n</main>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"footer\",\"tagName\":\"footer\",\"theme\":\"tanya-barrans\"} /-->\n', 'Single Posts', 'Displays a single post on your website unless a custom template has been applied to that post or a dedicated template exists.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '99-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-08-17 23:12:31', '2026-08-17 23:12:31', '', 99, 'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/?p=117', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(118, 2, '2026-08-17 23:19:57', '2026-08-17 23:19:57', '<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"header\",\"tagName\":\"header\",\"theme\":\"tanya-barrans\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<style id=\"tb-blog-template-styles\">\n/* Shared Journal article template - applies to every post using Single Posts */\n.tb-article-page {\n  background: #fbf8f2 !important;\n  background-image: none !important;\n  color: #25364a;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.tb-article-header {\n  width: min(860px, calc(100% - 48px));\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: clamp(64px, 8vw, 112px) 0 44px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n.tb-article-title {\n  max-width: 820px;\n  margin-left: auto !important;\n  margin-right: auto !important;\n  line-height: 1.04 !important;\n}\n.tb-article-dek {\n  max-width: 680px;\n  margin: 22px auto 0 !important;\n  font-size: clamp(18px, 2vw, 23px);\n  line-height: 1.55;\n}\n.tb-article-hero {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: none !important;\n  padding: 0 24px clamp(48px, 6vw, 80px);\n  background: #fbf8f2 !important;\n  background-image: none !important;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n.tb-article-hero .wp-block-post-featured-image {\n  width: min(1040px, 100%);\n  margin: 0 auto !important;\n}\n.tb-article-hero .wp-block-post-featured-image img {\n  display: block;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: clamp(360px, 52vw, 620px);\n  object-fit: cover;\n  border-radius: 18px;\n  box-shadow: 0 18px 52px rgba(52,76,106,.13);\n}\n.tb-article-body {\n  width: min(720px, calc(100% - 48px));\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding-bottom: clamp(72px, 9vw, 120px);\n  font-size: 18px;\n  line-height: 1.78;\n}\n.tb-article-body h2 {\n  margin-top: 2.4em;\n  color: #344c6a;\n}\n.tb-article-body .alignwide {\n  width: min(1040px, calc(100vw - 48px));\n  max-width: none;\n  margin-left: 50% !important;\n  transform: translateX(-50%);\n}\n.tb-article-body figure img {\n  border-radius: 14px;\n}\n.tb-article-explore {\n  padding: clamp(64px, 8vw, 96px) 24px !important;\n  background: #344c6a !important;\n}\n.tb-article-explore .tb-page-shell {\n  width: min(940px, 100%);\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.tb-article-explore__links {\n  max-width: 820px;\n  margin: 34px auto 0;\n}\n.tb-newsletter-feature {\n  width: min(1040px, calc(100% - 48px)) !important;\n  max-width: 1040px !important;\n  min-height: 420px;\n  margin: clamp(72px, 9vw, 112px) auto !important;\n  display: grid !important;\n  grid-template-columns: minmax(300px, .9fr) minmax(420px, 1.25fr);\n  overflow: hidden;\n  border-radius: 18px;\n  box-shadow: 0 18px 55px rgba(52,76,106,.12);\n}\n.tb-newsletter-feature__image {\n  min-height: 420px;\n  background-size: cover !important;\n  background-position: center !important;\n}\n.tb-newsletter-feature__content {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: clamp(44px, 6vw, 72px) !important;\n}\n.tb-newsletter-fields {\n  display: grid !important;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr auto;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n.tb-article-author {\n  padding: clamp(72px, 9vw, 112px) 24px !important;\n  background: #f1e8dc !important;\n}\n.tb-article-author__inner {\n  width: min(1000px, 100%);\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  display: grid !important;\n  grid-template-columns: minmax(280px, 380px) 1fr;\n  gap: clamp(42px, 7vw, 82px);\n  align-items: center;\n}\n.tb-article-author__inner > img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 500px;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  object-position: center top;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  box-shadow: 0 16px 42px rgba(52,76,106,.14);\n}\n.tb-article-author h2 {\n  max-width: 560px;\n  font-size: clamp(36px, 4vw, 54px);\n  line-height: 1.05;\n}\n.tb-article-comments {\n  width: min(820px, calc(100% - 48px));\n  margin: clamp(64px, 8vw, 96px) auto !important;\n  padding: clamp(42px, 6vw, 68px) !important;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(52,76,106,.14);\n  border-radius: 18px;\n  box-shadow: 0 14px 42px rgba(52,76,106,.08);\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n.tb-article-comments textarea,\n.tb-article-comments input:not([type=\"submit\"]) {\n  width: 100%;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n.tb-article-navigation {\n  width: min(1040px, calc(100% - 48px));\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 0 0 clamp(72px, 8vw, 104px);\n}\n@media (max-width: 760px) {\n  .tb-article-header { width: min(100% - 32px, 860px); padding-top: 48px; }\n  .tb-article-hero { padding-left: 16px; padding-right: 16px; }\n  .tb-article-hero .wp-block-post-featured-image img { height: 58vw; min-height: 260px; border-radius: 12px; }\n  .tb-article-body { width: min(100% - 36px, 720px); font-size: 17px; }\n  .tb-article-body .alignwide { width: calc(100vw - 32px); }\n  .tb-newsletter-feature { width: calc(100% - 32px) !important; grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .tb-newsletter-feature__image { min-height: 280px; }\n  .tb-newsletter-fields { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; }\n  .tb-article-author__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; }\n  .tb-article-author__inner > img { height: 420px; }\n  .tb-article-comments, .tb-article-navigation { width: calc(100% - 32px); }\n}\n</style>\n<!-- /wp:html --> <!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"main\",\"className\":\"tb-article-page\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<main class=\"wp-block-group tb-article-page\">\n\n	<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-article-header\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"920px\"}} -->\n	<header class=\"wp-block-group tb-article-header\">\n		<!-- wp:post-terms {\"term\":\"category\",\"className\":\"tb-journal-label\"} /-->\n		<!-- wp:post-title {\"level\":1,\"className\":\"tb-article-title\",\"fontSize\":\"x-large\"} /-->\n		<!-- wp:post-excerpt {\"moreText\":\"\",\"excerptLength\":32,\"className\":\"tb-article-dek\"} /-->\n		<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-article-meta\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"wrap\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-group tb-article-meta\">\n			<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>From Tanya Barrans</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n			<!-- wp:post-date /-->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:group -->\n	</header>\n	<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n	<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-article-hero\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"1200px\"}} -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-group tb-article-hero\">\n		<!-- wp:post-featured-image {\"aspectRatio\":\"16/9\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\"} /-->\n	</div>\n	<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n	<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-article-body\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"740px\",\"wideSize\":\"1200px\"}} -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-group tb-article-body\">\n		<!-- wp:post-content {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"740px\",\"wideSize\":\"1200px\"}} /-->\n	</div>\n	<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n	<!-- wp:html -->\n	<aside class=\"tb-article-explore\" aria-labelledby=\"article-explore-title\">\n		<div class=\"tb-page-shell\">\n			<p class=\"tb-page-kicker\">Keep exploring</p>\n			<h2 id=\"article-explore-title\">Continue loving where you live.</h2>\n			<div class=\"tb-article-explore__links\">\n				<a href=\"/buy/\"><span>Planning a move</span><strong>Visit the Buyer Hub</strong></a>\n				<a href=\"/sell/\"><span>Thinking about selling</span><strong>Visit the Seller Hub</strong></a>\n			</div>\n		</div>\n	</aside>\n	<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n	<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"tb-newsletter-feature\",\"backgroundColor\":\"base\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"},\"metadata\":{\"patternName\":\"tanya-barrans/newsletter\",\"name\":\"Newsletter Signup\",\"categories\":[\"featured\"]}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull tb-newsletter-feature has-base-background-color has-background\">\n\n	<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-newsletter-feature__image\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-group tb-newsletter-feature__image\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"background-image:url(/wp-content/themes/tanya-barrans/assets/images/lwyl-coffee.jpg)\"></div>\n	<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n	<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-newsletter-feature__content tb-reveal\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-group tb-newsletter-feature__content tb-reveal\">\n		<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"tb-script-accent\"} -->\n		<p class=\"tb-script-accent\">Let’s stay in touch</p>\n		<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n		<!-- wp:heading {\"fontSize\":\"x-large\"} -->\n		<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-x-large-font-size\">Notes worth opening.</h2>\n		<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n		<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"graphite\"} -->\n		<p class=\"has-graphite-color has-text-color\">Useful home ideas, local stories, and honest real estate guidance—delivered with no pressure and no polished filler.</p>\n		<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n		<!-- wp:html -->\n		<form class=\"tb-newsletter-form\" novalidate>\n			<div class=\"tb-newsletter-fields\">\n				<label class=\"tb-sr-only\" for=\"tb-nl-name\">First name</label>\n				<input type=\"text\" id=\"tb-nl-name\" name=\"name\" class=\"tb-newsletter-input\" placeholder=\"First name\" autocomplete=\"given-name\" />\n\n				<label class=\"tb-sr-only\" for=\"tb-nl-email\">Email address</label>\n				<input type=\"email\" id=\"tb-nl-email\" name=\"email\" class=\"tb-newsletter-input\" placeholder=\"Email address\" autocomplete=\"email\" required />\n\n				<div class=\"tb-newsletter-hp\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n					<label for=\"tb-nl-website\">Website</label>\n					<input type=\"text\" id=\"tb-nl-website\" name=\"website\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" />\n				</div>\n\n				<button type=\"submit\" class=\"tb-newsletter-submit\">Subscribe</button>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"tb-newsletter-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n		</form>\n		<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n		<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"tb-newsletter-feature__privacy\"} -->\n		<p class=\"tb-newsletter-feature__privacy\">No spam. Unsubscribe whenever you like.</p>\n		<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n	</div>\n	<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n	<!-- wp:html -->\n	<section class=\"tb-article-author\" aria-labelledby=\"article-author-title\">\n		<div class=\"tb-page-shell tb-article-author__inner\">\n			<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/about-main.jpg\" alt=\"Tanya Barrans, Renton real estate broker\" width=\"934\" height=\"1400\" loading=\"lazy\">\n			<div>\n				<p class=\"tb-page-kicker\">Meet Tanya</p>\n				<h2 id=\"article-author-title\">Local perspective. Honest guidance.</h2>\n				<p>Tanya Barrans helps people make thoughtful decisions about their homes, their neighborhoods, and their next move across Renton and the South Sound.</p>\n				<div class=\"tb-page-actions\">\n					<a class=\"tb-page-button tb-page-button--primary\" href=\"/about/\">More About Tanya</a>\n					<a class=\"tb-text-link\" href=\"/contact/\">Ask Tanya a question <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></a>\n				</div>\n			</div>\n		</div>\n	</section>\n	<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n	<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-article-comments\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"740px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group tb-article-comments\">\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Join the conversation</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Have a tip, a question, or a story of your own? I’d love to hear it.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:comments -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-comments\">\n<!-- wp:comments-title {\"showPostTitle\":false} /-->\n<!-- wp:comment-template -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:avatar {\"size\":48} /--><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:comment-author-name /--><!-- wp:comment-date /--></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:comment-content /-->\n<!-- wp:comment-reply-link /-->\n<!-- /wp:comment-template -->\n<!-- wp:post-comments-form /-->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:comments -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group --> <!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-article-navigation\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"1200px\"}} -->\n	<nav class=\"wp-block-group tb-article-navigation\" aria-label=\"Article navigation\">\n		<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"wrap\",\"justifyContent\":\"space-between\"}} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-group\">\n			<!-- wp:post-navigation-link {\"type\":\"previous\",\"label\":\"Previous story\",\"showTitle\":true,\"linkLabel\":true} /-->\n			<!-- wp:post-navigation-link {\"type\":\"next\",\"label\":\"Next story\",\"showTitle\":true,\"linkLabel\":true} /-->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:group -->\n		<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"tb-journal-back-link\"} --><p class=\"has-text-align-center tb-journal-back-link\"><a href=\"/blog/\">Back to the Journal</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n	</nav>\n	<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n</main>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"footer\",\"tagName\":\"footer\",\"theme\":\"tanya-barrans\"} /-->\n', 'Single Posts', 'Displays a single post on your website unless a custom template has been applied to that post or a dedicated template exists.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '99-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-08-17 23:19:57', '2026-08-17 23:19:57', '', 99, 'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/?p=118', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(119, 2, '2026-08-17 23:22:45', '2026-08-17 23:22:45', '<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"header\",\"tagName\":\"header\",\"theme\":\"tanya-barrans\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<style id=\"tb-blog-template-styles\">\n/* Shared Journal article template - applies to every post using Single Posts */\n.tb-article-page {\n  background: #fbf8f2 !important;\n  background-image: none !important;\n  color: #25364a;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.tb-article-header {\n  width: min(860px, calc(100% - 48px));\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: clamp(64px, 8vw, 112px) 0 44px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n.tb-article-title {\n  max-width: 820px;\n  margin-left: auto !important;\n  margin-right: auto !important;\n  line-height: 1.04 !important;\n}\n.tb-article-dek {\n  max-width: 680px;\n  margin: 22px auto 0 !important;\n  font-size: clamp(18px, 2vw, 23px);\n  line-height: 1.55;\n}\n.tb-article-hero {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: none !important;\n  padding: 0 24px clamp(48px, 6vw, 80px);\n  background: #fbf8f2 !important;\n  background-image: none !important;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n.tb-article-hero .wp-block-post-featured-image {\n  width: min(1040px, 100%);\n  margin: 0 auto !important;\n}\n.tb-article-hero .wp-block-post-featured-image img {\n  display: block;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: clamp(360px, 52vw, 620px);\n  object-fit: cover;\n  border-radius: 18px;\n  box-shadow: 0 18px 52px rgba(52,76,106,.13);\n}\n.tb-article-body {\n  width: min(720px, calc(100% - 48px));\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding-bottom: clamp(72px, 9vw, 120px);\n  font-size: 18px;\n  line-height: 1.78;\n}\n.tb-article-body h2 {\n  margin-top: 2.4em;\n  color: #344c6a;\n}\n.tb-article-body .alignwide {\n  width: min(1040px, calc(100vw - 48px));\n  max-width: none;\n  margin-left: 50% !important;\n  transform: translateX(-50%);\n}\n.tb-article-body figure img {\n  border-radius: 14px;\n}\n.tb-article-explore {\n  padding: clamp(64px, 8vw, 96px) 24px !important;\n  background: #344c6a !important;\n}\n.tb-article-explore .tb-page-shell {\n  width: min(940px, 100%);\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.tb-article-explore__links {\n  max-width: 820px;\n  margin: 34px auto 0;\n}\n.tb-newsletter-feature {\n  width: min(1040px, calc(100% - 48px)) !important;\n  max-width: 1040px !important;\n  min-height: 420px;\n  margin: clamp(72px, 9vw, 112px) auto !important;\n  display: grid !important;\n  grid-template-columns: minmax(300px, .9fr) minmax(420px, 1.25fr);\n  overflow: hidden;\n  border-radius: 18px;\n  box-shadow: 0 18px 55px rgba(52,76,106,.12);\n}\n.tb-newsletter-feature__image {\n  min-height: 420px;\n  background-size: cover !important;\n  background-position: center !important;\n}\n.tb-newsletter-feature__content {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: clamp(44px, 6vw, 72px) !important;\n}\n.tb-newsletter-fields {\n  display: grid !important;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr auto;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n.tb-article-author {\n  padding: clamp(72px, 9vw, 112px) 24px !important;\n  background: #f1e8dc !important;\n}\n.tb-article-author__inner {\n  width: min(1000px, 100%);\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  display: grid !important;\n  grid-template-columns: minmax(280px, 380px) 1fr;\n  gap: clamp(42px, 7vw, 82px);\n  align-items: center;\n}\n.tb-article-author__inner > img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 500px;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  object-position: center top;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  box-shadow: 0 16px 42px rgba(52,76,106,.14);\n}\n.tb-article-author h2 {\n  max-width: 560px;\n  font-size: clamp(36px, 4vw, 54px);\n  line-height: 1.05;\n}\n.tb-article-comments {\n  width: min(820px, calc(100% - 48px));\n  margin: clamp(64px, 8vw, 96px) auto !important;\n  padding: clamp(42px, 6vw, 68px) !important;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(52,76,106,.14);\n  border-radius: 18px;\n  box-shadow: 0 14px 42px rgba(52,76,106,.08);\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n.tb-article-comments textarea,\n.tb-article-comments input:not([type=\"submit\"]) {\n  width: 100%;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n.tb-article-navigation {\n  width: min(1040px, calc(100% - 48px));\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 0 0 clamp(72px, 8vw, 104px);\n}\n@media (max-width: 760px) {\n  .tb-article-header { width: min(100% - 32px, 860px); padding-top: 48px; }\n  .tb-article-hero { padding-left: 16px; padding-right: 16px; }\n  .tb-article-hero .wp-block-post-featured-image img { height: 58vw; min-height: 260px; border-radius: 12px; }\n  .tb-article-body { width: min(100% - 36px, 720px); font-size: 17px; }\n  .tb-article-body .alignwide { width: calc(100vw - 32px); }\n  .tb-newsletter-feature { width: calc(100% - 32px) !important; grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .tb-newsletter-feature__image { min-height: 280px; }\n  .tb-newsletter-fields { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; }\n  .tb-article-author__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; }\n  .tb-article-author__inner > img { height: 420px; }\n  .tb-article-comments, .tb-article-navigation { width: calc(100% - 32px); }\n}\n</style>\n<!-- /wp:html --> <!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"main\",\"className\":\"tb-article-page\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<main class=\"wp-block-group tb-article-page\">\n\n	<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-article-header\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"920px\"}} -->\n	<header class=\"wp-block-group tb-article-header\">\n		<!-- wp:post-terms {\"term\":\"category\",\"className\":\"tb-journal-label\"} /-->\n		<!-- wp:post-title {\"level\":1,\"className\":\"tb-article-title\",\"fontSize\":\"x-large\"} /-->\n		<!-- wp:post-excerpt {\"moreText\":\"\",\"excerptLength\":32,\"className\":\"tb-article-dek\"} /-->\n		<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-article-meta\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"wrap\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-group tb-article-meta\">\n			<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>From Tanya Barrans</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n			<!-- wp:post-date /-->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:group -->\n	</header>\n	<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n	<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-article-hero\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"1200px\"}} -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-group tb-article-hero\">\n		<!-- wp:post-featured-image {\"aspectRatio\":\"16/9\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\"} /-->\n	</div>\n	<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n	<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-article-body\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"740px\",\"wideSize\":\"1200px\"}} -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-group tb-article-body\">\n		<!-- wp:post-content {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"740px\",\"wideSize\":\"1200px\"}} /-->\n	</div>\n	<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n	<!-- wp:html -->\n	<aside class=\"tb-article-explore\" aria-labelledby=\"article-explore-title\">\n		<div class=\"tb-page-shell\">\n			<p class=\"tb-page-kicker\">Keep exploring</p>\n			<h2 id=\"article-explore-title\">Continue loving where you live.</h2>\n			<div class=\"tb-article-explore__links\">\n				<a href=\"/buy/\"><span>Planning a move</span><strong>Visit the Buyer Hub</strong></a>\n				<a href=\"/sell/\"><span>Thinking about selling</span><strong>Visit the Seller Hub</strong></a>\n			</div>\n		</div>\n	</aside>\n	<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n	<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"tb-newsletter-feature\",\"backgroundColor\":\"base\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"},\"metadata\":{\"patternName\":\"tanya-barrans/newsletter\",\"name\":\"Newsletter Signup\",\"categories\":[\"featured\"]}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull tb-newsletter-feature has-base-background-color has-background\">\n\n	<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-newsletter-feature__image\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-group tb-newsletter-feature__image\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"background-image:url(/wp-content/themes/tanya-barrans/assets/images/lwyl-coffee.jpg)\"></div>\n	<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n	<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-newsletter-feature__content tb-reveal\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n	<div class=\"wp-block-group tb-newsletter-feature__content tb-reveal\">\n		<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"tb-script-accent\"} -->\n		<p class=\"tb-script-accent\">Let’s stay in touch</p>\n		<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n		<!-- wp:heading {\"fontSize\":\"x-large\"} -->\n		<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-x-large-font-size\">Notes worth opening.</h2>\n		<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n		<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"graphite\"} -->\n		<p class=\"has-graphite-color has-text-color\">Useful home ideas, local stories, and honest real estate guidance—delivered with no pressure and no polished filler.</p>\n		<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n		<!-- wp:html -->\n		<form class=\"tb-newsletter-form\" novalidate>\n			<div class=\"tb-newsletter-fields\">\n				<label class=\"tb-sr-only\" for=\"tb-nl-name\">First name</label>\n				<input type=\"text\" id=\"tb-nl-name\" name=\"name\" class=\"tb-newsletter-input\" placeholder=\"First name\" autocomplete=\"given-name\" />\n\n				<label class=\"tb-sr-only\" for=\"tb-nl-email\">Email address</label>\n				<input type=\"email\" id=\"tb-nl-email\" name=\"email\" class=\"tb-newsletter-input\" placeholder=\"Email address\" autocomplete=\"email\" required />\n\n				<div class=\"tb-newsletter-hp\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n					<label for=\"tb-nl-website\">Website</label>\n					<input type=\"text\" id=\"tb-nl-website\" name=\"website\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" />\n				</div>\n\n				<button type=\"submit\" class=\"tb-newsletter-submit\">Subscribe</button>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"tb-newsletter-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n		</form>\n		<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n		<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"tb-newsletter-feature__privacy\"} -->\n		<p class=\"tb-newsletter-feature__privacy\">No spam. Unsubscribe whenever you like.</p>\n		<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n	</div>\n	<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n	<!-- wp:html -->\n	<section class=\"tb-article-author\" aria-labelledby=\"article-author-title\">\n		<div class=\"tb-page-shell tb-article-author__inner\">\n			<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/about-main.jpg\" alt=\"Tanya Barrans, Renton real estate broker\" width=\"934\" height=\"1400\" loading=\"lazy\">\n			<div>\n				<p class=\"tb-page-kicker\">Meet Tanya</p>\n				<h2 id=\"article-author-title\">Local perspective. Honest guidance.</h2>\n				<p>Tanya Barrans helps people make thoughtful decisions about their homes, their neighborhoods, and their next move across Renton and the South Sound.</p>\n				<div class=\"tb-page-actions\">\n					<a class=\"tb-page-button tb-page-button--primary\" href=\"/about/\">More About Tanya</a>\n					<a class=\"tb-text-link\" href=\"/contact/\">Ask Tanya a question <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></a>\n				</div>\n			</div>\n		</div>\n	</section>\n	<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n	<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-article-comments\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"740px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group tb-article-comments\">\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Join the conversation</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Have a tip, a question, or a story of your own? I’d love to hear it.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:comments -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-comments\">\n<!-- wp:comments-title {\"showPostTitle\":false} /-->\n<!-- wp:comment-template -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:avatar {\"size\":48} /--><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:comment-author-name /--><!-- wp:comment-date /--></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:comment-content /-->\n<!-- wp:comment-reply-link /-->\n<!-- /wp:comment-template -->\n<!-- wp:post-comments-form /-->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:comments -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group --> <!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tb-article-navigation\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"1200px\"}} -->\n	<nav class=\"wp-block-group tb-article-navigation\" aria-label=\"Article navigation\">\n		<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"wrap\",\"justifyContent\":\"space-between\"}} -->\n		<div class=\"wp-block-group\">\n			<!-- wp:post-navigation-link {\"type\":\"previous\",\"label\":\"Previous story\",\"showTitle\":true,\"linkLabel\":true} /-->\n			<!-- wp:post-navigation-link {\"type\":\"next\",\"label\":\"Next story\",\"showTitle\":true,\"linkLabel\":true} /-->\n		</div>\n		<!-- /wp:group -->\n		<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"tb-journal-back-link\"} --><p class=\"has-text-align-center tb-journal-back-link\"><a href=\"/blog/\">Back to the Journal</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n	</nav>\n	<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n</main>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"footer\",\"tagName\":\"footer\",\"theme\":\"tanya-barrans\"} /-->\n', 'Blog Posts', 'Displays a single post on your website unless a custom template has been applied to that post or a dedicated template exists.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '99-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-08-17 23:22:45', '2026-08-17 23:22:45', '', 99, 'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/?p=119', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
