6</h1><div class=\"tbp-price\">$375,000</div><div class=\"tbp-actions\"><a class=\"tbp-btn\" href=\"/contact/\">Schedule a Private Showing</a><a class=\"tbp-btn alt\" href=\"#property-story\">Explore the Home</a></div></div></section><section class=\"tbp-facts\"><div class=\"tbp-fact\"><strong>2</strong><span>Bedrooms</span></div><div class=\"tbp-fact\"><strong>1.75</strong><span>Bathrooms</span></div><div class=\"tbp-fact\"><strong>972</strong><span>Square feet</span></div><div class=\"tbp-fact\"><strong>0.12</strong><span>Acres</span></div><div class=\"tbp-fact\"><strong>2534297</strong><span>Listing number</span></div></section><section id=\"property-story\" class=\"tbp-story\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\">The Property Story</div><h2>A Pacific Northwest escape with room for your next idea</h2><p>Set beneath a canopy of evergreens in the private waterfront community of Beachcrest, this cedar-sided home feels like the kind of place where weekends naturally stretch a little longer. The setting is peaceful and tucked away, yet Hawks Prairie shopping, dining, and I-5 are still close enough for everyday convenience.<br><br>Inside, two fireplaces, generous living spaces, built-in storage, and a flexible floor plan give the home warmth and possibility. Outside the front door, Beachcrest residents enjoy private shoreline access, a high-tide marina, boat launch, waterfront gathering areas, parks, and trails—the kind of amenities that make an ordinary Tuesday feel a little more like vacation.</p></section><section class=\"tbp-gallery\"><img src=\"https://assets.jlscontent.com/photos/wanwmls/253/429/2534297-1.jpg\" alt=\"Replace with primary listing photo\"><img src=\"https://assets.jlscontent.com/photos/wanwmls/253/429/2534297-2.jpg\" alt=\"Replace with listing photo\"><img src=\"https://assets.jlscontent.com/photos/wanwmls/253/429/2534297-3.jpg\" alt=\"Replace with listing photo\"><img src=\"https://assets.jlscontent.com/photos/wanwmls/253/429/2534297-6.jpg\" alt=\"Replace with listing photo\"></section><section class=\"tbp-section\"><div class=\"tbp-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://assets.jlscontent.com/photos/wanwmls/253/429/2534297-15.jpg)\"></div><div class=\"tbp-copy\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\">Inside the Home</div><h2>Warm, flexible living spaces</h2><p>At 972 square feet, the home makes thoughtful use of every room. Open living areas create flexibility for quiet evenings, casual entertaining, or coming home after a day on the water. Two wood-burning fireplaces add the cozy cabin character that fits this wooded setting so well.</p><ul class=\"tbp-feature-list\"><li>Open, adaptable living areas</li><li>Two bedrooms</li><li>Two wood-burning fireplaces</li><li>Built-in storage throughout</li></ul></div></section><section class=\"tbp-section reverse\"><div class=\"tbp-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://assets.jlscontent.com/photos/wanwmls/253/429/2534297-10.jpg)\"></div><div class=\"tbp-copy\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\">Gather Here</div><h2>A kitchen ready for everyday life</h2><p>The kitchen is compact, practical, and full of warmth, with classic wood cabinetry, generous counter space, and pantry shelving that helps the room live larger. It is comfortable as-is and offers a great foundation for someone who wants to make it their own over time.</p><ul class=\"tbp-feature-list\"><li>Dishwasher, range, refrigerator + microwave</li><li>Generous work surfaces</li><li>Built-in pantry shelving</li><li>Courtyard connection</li></ul></div></section><section class=\"tbp-section\"><div class=\"tbp-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://assets.jlscontent.com/photos/wanwmls/253/429/2534297-29.jpg)\"></div><div class=\"tbp-copy\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\">Room to Exhale</div><h2>A detached studio with big possibilities</h2><p>The detached garage building is where this property becomes especially interesting. Along with parking, laundry, a bathroom, workshop space, and extensive shelving, the building includes a massive vaulted loft with exposed beams. Picture a home office, art studio, fitness room, hobby space, gear headquarters, or creative retreat—the blank canvas is already here.</p></div></section><section class=\"tbp-highlights\"><div class=\"tbp-highlights-inner\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\" style=\"text-align:center;color:#d6a3b5\">The Details</div><h2>What makes this home stand out</h2><div class=\"tbp-highlight-grid\"><div class=\"tbp-highlight\"><h3>Private Beachcrest shoreline</h3><p>Residents enjoy key-code access to more than 1,500 feet of saltwater shoreline, waterfront gathering areas, parks, and trails.</p></div><div class=\"tbp-highlight\"><h3>Garage, workshop + loft</h3><p>A detached garage building adds a bathroom, laundry, built-in shelving, workshop space, and a dramatic vaulted loft.</p></div><div class=\"tbp-highlight\"><h3>Marina, launch + coastal access</h3><p>Launch a kayak, paddleboard, beachcomb, or enjoy the high-tide marina and boat launch just inside the community.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"tbp-neighborhood\"><div class=\"tbp-neighborhood-copy\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\">Around the Neighborhood</div><h2>Beachcrest: waterfront community living without the waterfront-home price</h2><p>Beachcrest is tucked along Puget Sound in northeast Olympia, surrounded by evergreens and recreation. The home feels removed from the rush, while Hawks Prairie shopping and dining, JBLM, and I-5 remain within practical reach. For buyers who want outdoor access and community amenities without giving up everyday convenience, this location offers a rare balance.</p><a class=\"tbp-btn\" href=\"https://beachcrest.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Explore Beachcrest</a></div><div class=\"tbp-map\"></div></section><section class=\"tbp-contact\"><img src=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/gallery-2-new.jpg\" alt=\"Tanya Barrans\"><div class=\"tbp-contact-copy\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\">Private Showings + Questions</div><h2>Let’s take a closer look.</h2><p>Want the disclosures, offer details, or a private tour? Tanya will make sure you have the context—not just the listing facts—to decide whether this home feels right.</p><div class=\"tbp-actions\"><a class=\"tbp-btn\" href=\"/contact/\">Ask Tanya About This Home</a><a class=\"tbp-btn alt\" href=\"tel:4255374728\">Call (425) 537-4728</a></div></div></section></div><!-- /wp:html -->', '5246 Yearley Drive NE | Olympia, WA', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '90219-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-08-20 06:29:55', '2026-08-20 06:29:55', '', 90219, 'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/?p=90223', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
