br>Puyallup, WA</h1><div class=\"tbp-price\">$545,000</div><div class=\"tbp-actions\"><a class=\"tbp-btn\" href=\"/contact/\">Schedule a Private Showing</a><a class=\"tbp-btn alt\" href=\"#property-story\">Explore the Home</a></div></div></section><section class=\"tbp-facts\"><div class=\"tbp-fact\"><strong>4</strong><span>Bedrooms</span></div><div class=\"tbp-fact\"><strong>2.5</strong><span>Bathrooms</span></div><div class=\"tbp-fact\"><strong>2,201</strong><span>Square feet</span></div><div class=\"tbp-fact\"><strong>0.08</strong><span>Acres</span></div><div class=\"tbp-fact\"><strong>2546584</strong><span>Listing number</span></div></section><section id=\"property-story\" class=\"tbp-story\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\">The Property Story</div><h2>A home that makes room for the way life really happens</h2><p>With more than 2,200 square feet, four bedrooms, and a thoughtful layout, this home offers flexibility that keeps working as life changes. The covered porch faces a neighborhood park, while the open main floor makes space for busy mornings, homework at the island, guests, and movie nights by the gas fireplace.</p></section><section class=\"tbp-gallery\"><img src=\"https://assets.jlscontent.com/photos/wanwmls/254/658/2546584-1.jpg\" alt=\"18026 75th Avenue E in Puyallup\"><img src=\"https://assets.jlscontent.com/photos/wanwmls/254/658/2546584-2.jpg\" alt=\"18026 75th Avenue E in Puyallup\"><img src=\"https://assets.jlscontent.com/photos/wanwmls/254/658/2546584-24.jpg\" alt=\"18026 75th Avenue E in Puyallup\"><img src=\"https://assets.jlscontent.com/photos/wanwmls/254/658/2546584-25.jpg\" alt=\"18026 75th Avenue E in Puyallup\"></section><section class=\"tbp-section\"><div class=\"tbp-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://assets.jlscontent.com/photos/wanwmls/254/658/2546584-4.jpg)\"></div><div class=\"tbp-copy\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\">Inside the Home</div><h2>Comfortable spaces with room to adapt</h2><p>The main level flows from a generous entry into connected living, dining, and kitchen areas. A separate flex room can become a dining room, office, sitting room, or play space.</p><ul class=\"tbp-feature-list\"><li>Open-concept main floor</li><li>Four bedrooms upstairs</li><li>Gas fireplace</li><li>Flexible bonus room</li></ul></div></section><section class=\"tbp-section reverse\"><div class=\"tbp-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://assets.jlscontent.com/photos/wanwmls/254/658/2546584-9.jpg)\"></div><div class=\"tbp-copy\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\">Gather Here</div><h2>The kitchen at the center of it all</h2><p>Granite countertops, stainless appliances, abundant cabinetry, a corner pantry, and a spacious island give this kitchen room for meal prep, morning coffee, and lingering conversations.</p><ul class=\"tbp-feature-list\"><li>Stainless appliances</li><li>Granite countertops</li><li>Corner pantry + cabinetry</li><li>Large gathering island</li></ul></div></section><section class=\"tbp-section\"><div class=\"tbp-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://assets.jlscontent.com/photos/wanwmls/254/658/2546584-13.jpg)\"></div><div class=\"tbp-copy\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\">Room to Exhale</div><h2>A primary suite designed for unwinding</h2><p>The spacious primary suite includes a walk-in closet and private five-piece bath. Three additional bedrooms offer room for guests, hobbies, remote work, or a growing household.</p></div></section><section class=\"tbp-highlights\"><div class=\"tbp-highlights-inner\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\" style=\"text-align:center;color:#d6a3b5\">The Details</div><h2>What makes this home stand out</h2><div class=\"tbp-highlight-grid\"><div class=\"tbp-highlight\"><h3>Fully fenced backyard</h3><p>A private patio and fenced yard create space for gardening, pets, play, summer meals, or a quiet evening outside.</p></div><div class=\"tbp-highlight\"><h3>Everyday convenience</h3><p>An attached two-car garage, upstairs laundry, generous storage, and an adaptable floor plan make routines easier.</p></div><div class=\"tbp-highlight\"><h3>Connected neighborhood living</h3><p>A porch overlooking the park, nearby schools, shopping, and commuter access support an easy rhythm.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"tbp-neighborhood\"><div class=\"tbp-neighborhood-copy\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\">Around the Neighborhood</div><h2>Puyallup convenience with a neighborhood feel</h2><p>Near parks, shopping, dining, schools, and major routes, the home balances practical access with a welcoming residential setting.</p><a class=\"tbp-btn\" href=\"/contact/\">Ask Tanya About Puyallup</a></div><div class=\"tbp-map\"></div></section><section class=\"tbp-contact\"><img src=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/gallery-2-new.jpg\" alt=\"Tanya Barrans\"><div class=\"tbp-contact-copy\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\">Private Showings + Questions</div><h2>Let’s take a closer look.</h2><p>Want the disclosures, offer details, or a private tour? Tanya will make sure you have the context—not just the listing facts—to decide whether this home feels right.</p><div class=\"tbp-actions\"><a class=\"tbp-btn\" href=\"/contact/\">Ask Tanya About This Home</a><a class=\"tbp-btn alt\" href=\"tel:4255374728\">Call (425) 537-4728</a></div></div></section></div><!-- /wp:html -->', '18026 75th Avenue E | Puyallup, WA', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '90224-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-08-20 06:35:06', '2026-08-20 06:35:06', '', 90224, 'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/?p=90225', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
