content:center;padding:clamp(48px,7vw,95px)}.tbp-showcase-copy h2{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(2.5rem,4.5vw,4.5rem);line-height:1.03;margin:.5rem 0 1.2rem}.tbp-showcase-copy p{font-size:1.04rem;line-height:1.75;color:#3f4650}@media(max-width:850px){.tbp-showcase{grid-template-columns:1fr}.tbp-showcase-image{min-height:380px}}</style><div class=\"tb-property-template\"><section class=\"tbp-hero\"><div class=\"tbp-hero-card\"><span class=\"tbp-status\">PENDING</span><div class=\"tbp-kicker\">A Tanya Barrans Featured Listing</div><h1>441 S 51st Court<br>Renton, WA</h1><div class=\"tbp-price\">$515,000</div><div class=\"tbp-actions\"><a class=\"tbp-btn\" href=\"/contact/\">Schedule a Private Showing</a><a class=\"tbp-btn alt\" href=\"#property-story\">Explore the Home</a></div></div></section><section class=\"tbp-facts\"><div class=\"tbp-fact\"><strong>2</strong><span>Bedrooms</span></div><div class=\"tbp-fact\"><strong>2.25</strong><span>Bathrooms</span></div><div class=\"tbp-fact\"><strong>1,660</strong><span>Square feet</span></div><div class=\"tbp-fact\"><strong>Townhome</strong><span>Acres</span></div><div class=\"tbp-fact\"><strong>2485826</strong><span>Listing number</span></div></section><section id=\"property-story\" class=\"tbp-story\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\">The Property Story</div><h2>Light, flexibility, and a quieter place to come home to</h2><p>Vaulted ceilings and abundant natural light give this Renton townhome an open feeling from the moment you walk in. Tucked away from the main road, it offers privacy without giving up the convenience that makes this part of Renton so practical.</p></section><section class=\"tbp-gallery\"><img src=\"https://assets.jlscontent.com/photos/wanwmls/248/582/2485826-1.jpg\" alt=\"441 S 51st Court townhome in Renton\"><img src=\"https://assets.jlscontent.com/photos/wanwmls/248/582/2485826-11.jpg\" alt=\"441 S 51st Court townhome in Renton\"><img src=\"https://assets.jlscontent.com/photos/wanwmls/248/582/2485826-30.jpg\" alt=\"441 S 51st Court townhome in Renton\"><img src=\"https://assets.jlscontent.com/photos/wanwmls/248/582/2485826-36.jpg\" alt=\"441 S 51st Court townhome in Renton\"></section><section class=\"tbp-section\"><div class=\"tbp-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://assets.jlscontent.com/photos/wanwmls/248/582/2485826-3.jpg)\"></div><div class=\"tbp-copy\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\">Inside the Home</div><h2>An open layout filled with natural light</h2><p>The main living spaces connect easily while still offering defined places to gather, dine, and relax. Vaulted ceilings add volume, and the fireplace creates a warm focal point.</p><ul class=\"tbp-feature-list\"><li>Vaulted ceilings</li><li>Two bedrooms</li><li>Cozy fireplace</li><li>Open-concept living</li></ul></div></section><section class=\"tbp-section reverse\"><div class=\"tbp-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://assets.jlscontent.com/photos/wanwmls/248/582/2485826-13.jpg)\"></div><div class=\"tbp-copy\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\">Gather Here</div><h2>Fresh, functional, and connected</h2><p>White cabinetry, sleek counters, generous workspace, and a peninsula with bar seating make the kitchen practical for cooking and easy entertaining.</p><ul class=\"tbp-feature-list\"><li>Updated white cabinetry</li><li>Generous counter space</li><li>Breakfast-bar seating</li><li>Open to dining and living</li></ul></div></section><section class=\"tbp-section\"><div class=\"tbp-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://assets.jlscontent.com/photos/wanwmls/248/582/2485826-21.jpg)\"></div><div class=\"tbp-copy\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\">Room to Exhale</div><h2>A loft that gives you options</h2><p>The upstairs loft can become an office, reading nook, hobby space, or second sitting area. The oversized primary suite offers a walk-in closet, dual vanity, and separate shower.</p></div></section><section class=\"tbp-highlights\"><div class=\"tbp-highlights-inner\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\" style=\"text-align:center;color:#d6a3b5\">The Details</div><h2>What makes this home stand out</h2><div class=\"tbp-highlight-grid\"><div class=\"tbp-highlight\"><h3>Private deck in the trees</h3><p>The deck creates a peaceful spot for morning coffee, dinner, or unwinding among mature greenery.</p></div><div class=\"tbp-highlight\"><h3>Move-in confidence</h3><p>Pre-inspected, with recent HVAC and water-heater servicing plus refreshed attic insulation.</p></div><div class=\"tbp-highlight\"><h3>Storage + parking</h3><p>An attached two-car garage, additional driveway parking, walk-in closet, and thoughtful storage support everyday life.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"tbp-showcase\"><div class=\"tbp-showcase-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://assets.jlscontent.com/photos/wanwmls/248/582/2485826-11.jpg)\"></div><div class=\"tbp-showcase-copy\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\">Zillow Showcase + 3D Tour</div><h2>Walk through the home from wherever you are.</h2><p>Explore the rooms, layout, and flow in more detail with the immersive Zillow Showcase experience. It is the next best thing to stepping inside—then Tanya can arrange the real tour when you are ready.</p><div class=\"tbp-actions\"><a class=\"tbp-btn\" href=\"https://www.zillow.com/homedetails/441-S-51st-Ct-Renton-WA-98055/49080470_zpid/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Launch the 3D Tour</a><a class=\"tbp-btn alt\" href=\"/contact/\">Schedule an In-Person Tour</a></div></div></section><section class=\"tbp-neighborhood\"><div class=\"tbp-neighborhood-copy\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\">Around the Neighborhood</div><h2>Connected to Renton, Seattle, and the Eastside</h2><p>Minutes from The Landing, Southcenter, Sea-Tac Airport, Valley Medical Center, shopping, dining, and major commuter routes.</p><a class=\"tbp-btn\" href=\"/rooted-cities/\">Explore Renton Neighborhoods</a></div><div class=\"tbp-map\"></div></section><section class=\"tbp-contact\"><img src=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/gallery-2-new.jpg\" alt=\"Tanya Barrans\"><div class=\"tbp-contact-copy\"><div class=\"tbp-kicker\">Private Showings + Questions</div><h2>Let’s take a closer look.</h2><p>Want the disclosures, offer details, or a private tour? Tanya will make sure you have the context—not just the listing facts—to decide whether this home feels right.</p><div class=\"tbp-actions\"><a class=\"tbp-btn\" href=\"/contact/\">Ask Tanya About This Home</a><a class=\"tbp-btn alt\" href=\"tel:4255374728\">Call (425) 537-4728</a></div></div></section></div><!-- /wp:html -->', '441 S 51st Court | Renton, WA', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', '441-s-51st-court-renton-wa', '', '', '2026-08-20 06:36:51', '2026-08-20 06:36:51', '', 0, 'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/?page_id=90226', 0, 'page', '', 0),
