st Place  in Covington, WA\"></div><p><strong>20518 SE 261st Place </strong></p><p class=\"tb-sold-price\">$795,000 · Covington, WA</p><p class=\"tb-sold-details\">5 Beds 3.75 Baths 3260 SqFt</p><span class=\"tb-sold-more\">See Tanya’s local sales →</span></a><a class=\"tb-card tb-local-preview-card\" href=\"/local-sales-portfolio-renton-kent-maple-valley-ravensdale-covington/#kent\"><div class=\"tb-sales-photo\"><span class=\"tb-sales-tag\">Sold</span><img src=\"https://assets.jlscontent.com/photos/wanwmls/237/136/2371360.jpg\" alt=\"Sold home at 856 Hilltop Avenue  in Kent, WA\"></div><p><strong>856 Hilltop Avenue </strong></p><p class=\"tb-sold-price\">$999,999 · Kent, WA</p><p class=\"tb-sold-details\">4 Beds 2.5 Baths 2780 SqFt</p><span class=\"tb-sold-more\">See Tanya’s local sales →</span></a><a class=\"tb-card tb-local-preview-card\" href=\"/local-sales-portfolio-renton-kent-maple-valley-ravensdale-covington/#kent\"><div class=\"tb-sales-photo\"><span class=\"tb-sales-tag\">Sold</span><img src=\"https://assets.jlscontent.com/photos/wanwmls/199/328/1993287.jpg\" alt=\"Sold home at 11636 SE 227th Place  in Kent, WA\"></div><p><strong>11636 SE 227th Place </strong></p><p class=\"tb-sold-price\">$660,000 · Kent, WA</p><p class=\"tb-sold-details\">4 Beds 2.25 Baths 2872 SqFt</p><span class=\"tb-sold-more\">See Tanya’s local sales →</span></a><a class=\"tb-card tb-local-preview-card\" href=\"/local-sales-portfolio-renton-kent-maple-valley-ravensdale-covington/#maple-valley\"><div class=\"tb-sales-photo\"><span class=\"tb-sales-tag\">Sold</span><img src=\"https://assets.jlscontent.com/photos/wanwmls/158/673/1586736.jpg\" alt=\"Sold home at 22804 SE 239th Ct Unit 29 in Maple Valley, WA\"></div><p><strong>22804 SE 239th Ct Unit 29</strong></p><p class=\"tb-sold-price\">$652,950 · Maple Valley, WA</p><p class=\"tb-sold-details\">4 Beds 2.5 Baths 2501 SqFt</p><span class=\"tb-sold-more\">See Tanya’s local sales →</span></a><a class=\"tb-card tb-local-preview-card\" hre