tb-rooted-city__intro-grid{gap:34px}.tb-rooted-city__intro-card{min-height:320px;padding:30px}.tb-rooted-city__story-grid,.tb-rooted-city__category-grid,.tb-rooted-city__favorites,.tb-rooted-city__guide-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.tb-rooted-city__story--featured{grid-column:auto}.tb-rooted-city__duo>div{padding:54px 24px}.tb-rooted-city__actions{align-items:stretch}.tb-rooted-city__button{width:100%}}\n</style>\n<main class=\"tb-rooted-city\" style=\"--city-photo:url(\'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/covington-rainier-scaled.jpg\')\">\n<section class=\"tb-rooted-city__hero\">\n<div class=\"tb-rooted-city__photo\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Covington, Washington\"></div>\n<div class=\"tb-rooted-city__hero-copy\"><div>\n<p class=\"tb-rooted-city__eyebrow\">Helping you love where you live</p>\n<h1>Rooted in <span>Covington</span></h1>\n<p class=\"tb-rooted-city__dek\">A community with neighborhood energy, everyday convenience and Mount Rainier never too far from view. This is where local stories and practical Covington guides will live.</p>\n<div class=\"tb-rooted-city__actions\"><a class=\"tb-rooted-city__button\" href=\"#city-stories\">Explore the city notes</a><a class=\"tb-rooted-city__button tb-rooted-city__button--outline\" href=\"/contact/\">Suggest a story</a></div>\n<p class=\"tb-rooted-city__credit\"><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mount_Rainier_as_seen_from_a_Covington_neighborhood.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mount Rainier from a Covington neighborhood, Yordanpopovbg, CC BY-SA 4.0</a></p>\n</div></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tb-rooted-city__intro\" id=\"city-stories\"><div class=\"tb-rooted-city__shell tb-rooted-city__intro-grid\">\n<div class=\"tb-rooted-city__intro-card\"><p class=\"tb-rooted-city__eyebrow\">The Covington edit</p><h2>Easygoing neighborhoods with the essentials nearby.</h2></div>\n<div class=\"tb-rooted-city__intro-copy\"><p class=\"tb-rooted-city__eyebrow\">Start here</p><h2>A local guide that <em>grows with the city.</em></h2><p>Covington offers a suburban pace with straightforward access to Kent, Maple Valley and Highway 18. The goal here is to go beyond listings and build a useful guide to daily life, local businesses, community events and the questions people ask before moving.</p><div class=\"tb-rooted-city__actions\"><a class=\"tb-rooted-city__button\" href=\"/contact/\">Ask Tanya about Covington</a></div></div>\n</div></section>\n<section class=\"tb-rooted-city__section tb-rooted-city__section--khaki\"><div class=\"tb-rooted-city__shell\">\n<div class=\"tb-rooted-city__section-head\"><p class=\"tb-rooted-city__eyebrow\">Covington stories</p><h2>What we are <em>building next.</em></h2><p>A city hub should feel useful before it feels finished. These are the first three editorial tracks for Covington.</p></div>\n<div class=\"tb-rooted-city__story-grid\">\n<a class=\"tb-rooted-city__story tb-rooted-city__story--featured\" href=\"/living-in-covington-wa-local-guide/\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:none\"><p class=\"tb-rooted-city__eyebrow\">Featured city guide</p><h3>What it is really like to live in Covington</h3><p>Neighborhood feel, daily routines and the details people want before they make a move.</p></a>\n<article class=\"tb-rooted-city__story\"><p class=\"tb-rooted-city__eyebrow\">Coming next</p><h3>A local weekend in Covington</h3><p>Food, coffee, parks and a few good reasons to leave the house.</p></article>\n<article class=\"tb-rooted-city__story\"><p class=\"tb-rooted-city__eyebrow\">Coming next</p><h3>The people behind the places</h3><p>Small businesses and community stories worth knowing.</p></article>\n</div></div></section>\n<section class=\"tb-rooted-city__section tb-rooted-city__section--white\"><div class=\"tb-rooted-city__shell\">\n<div class=\"tb-rooted-city__section-head\"><p class=\"tb-rooted-city__eyebrow\">Explore Covington</p><h2>Find the part of town <em>you will love.</em></h2></div>\n<div class=\"tb-rooted-city__category-grid\">\n<div class=\"tb-rooted-city__category\" data-number=\"01\"><h3>Eat &amp; drink</h3></div>\n<div class=\"tb-rooted-city__category\" data-number=\"02\"><h3>Parks &amp; outdoors</h3></div>\n<div class=\"tb-rooted-city__category\" data-number=\"03\"><h3>Local businesses</h3></div>\n<div class=\"tb-rooted-city__category\" data-number=\"04\"><h3>Events &amp; community</h3></div>\n</div></div></section>\n<section class=\"tb-rooted-city__section\"><div class=\"tb-rooted-city__shell\">\n<div class=\"tb-rooted-city__section-head\"><p class=\"tb-rooted-city__eyebrow\">Tanya\'s Covington list</p><h2>The spots worth <em>saving.</em></h2><p>This section is ready for Tanya\'s real favorites. The placeholders keep the page useful without pretending the list is finished.</p></div>\n<div class=\"tb-rooted-city__favorites\">\n<article class=\"tb-rooted-city__favorite\"><h3>Favorite coffee</h3><p>The kind of place you recommend when someone asks for good coffee and a comfortable corner.</p><small>Tanya\'s pick coming soon</small></article>\n<article class=\"tb-rooted-city__favorite\"><h3>Go-to walk</h3><p>A reliable reset for fresh air, movement and a better look at the city.</p><small>Tanya\'s pick coming soon</small></article>\n<article class=\"tb-rooted-city__favorite\"><h3>Easy dinner</h3><p>A local spot that works when you want something good without making it a whole production.</p><small>Tanya\'s pick coming soon</small></article>\n<article class=\"tb-rooted-city__favorite\"><h3>Local gem</h3><p>The small business or community place that helps Covington feel like Covington.</p><small>Tanya\'s pick coming soon</small></article>\n</div></div></section>\n<section class=\"tb-rooted-city__section tb-rooted-city__section--white\"><div class=\"tb-rooted-city__shell\">\n<div class=\"tb-rooted-city__section-head\"><p class=\"tb-rooted-city__eyebrow\">Covington guide collection</p><h2>Practical answers, <em>all in one place.</em></h2></div>\n<div class=\"tb-rooted-city__guide-grid\">\n<a class=\"tb-rooted-city__guide\" href=\"/living-in-covington-wa-local-guide/\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:none\"><p class=\"tb-rooted-city__eyebrow\">Moving guide</p><h3>Living in Covington</h3><p>The practical guide to neighborhoods, routines and what to know before moving.</p><small>Read the guide</small></a>\n<article class=\"tb-rooted-city__guide\"><p class=\"tb-rooted-city__eyebrow\">Local guide</p><h3>A weekend in Covington</h3><p>A flexible list for food, coffee, parks and community events.</p><small>In progress</small></article>\n<article class=\"tb-rooted-city__guide\"><p class=\"tb-rooted-city__eyebrow\">Neighborhoods</p><h3>Where to look in Covington</h3><p>A plain-language comparison built around how you actually want to live.</p><small>In progress</small></article>\n</div></div></section>\n<section class=\"tb-rooted-city__duo\">\n<div class=\"tb-rooted-city__duo-left\"><p class=\"tb-rooted-city__eyebrow\">Love the place?</p><h2>Explore what it is like to live nearby.</h2><p>Compare Covington with the other communities Tanya knows and serves.</p><a class=\"tb-rooted-city__button tb-rooted-city__button--outline\" href=\"/neighborhoods/\">Explore all neighborhoods</a></div>\n<div class=\"tb-rooted-city__duo-right\"><p class=\"tb-rooted-city__eyebrow\">Share your Covington</p><h2>Know a story we should tell?</h2><p>Favorite shop, hidden gem or everyday hero. Help shape this guide with the places and people that make Covington feel like home.</p><a class=\"tb-rooted-city__button\" href=\"/contact/\">Suggest a Covington story</a></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tb-rooted-city__move\"><div class=\"tb-rooted-city__shell\"><h2>Thinking about making Covington home?</h2><p>Whether you are moving in, moving within the city or just curious about the market, Tanya can help you sort through the options without the sales pressure.</p><a class=\"tb-rooted-city__button\" href=\"/contact/\">Ask Tanya a question</a></div></section>\n</main>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"footer\",\"tagName\":\"footer\",\"theme\":\"tanya-barrans\"} /-->', 'Page: Covington', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '90239-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-08-23 06:04:27', '2026-08-23 06:04:27', '', 90239, 'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/?p=90338', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
