_name,.tb-city-card:nth-child(4) .tb-city-card__name{font-size:3rem}\n.tb-rooted-note{margin-top:52px;padding:30px 0 0;border-top:1px solid #d9d8d1;color:#596574;line-height:1.7}\n.tb-rooted-note a{color:var(--navy);font-weight:800}\n@media(max-width:900px){\n .tb-story__grid,.tb-places__head{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:34px}\n .tb-city-card,.tb-city-card:nth-child(1),.tb-city-card:nth-child(4){grid-column:span 6}\n}\n@media(max-width:620px){\n .tb-shell{width:min(100% - 36px,1180px)}\n .tb-rooted-hero{min-height:600px}\n .tb-rooted-hero__inner{padding:86px 0 64px}\n .tb-story,.tb-cities{padding:76px 0}.tb-places{padding:72px 0}\n .tb-city-card,.tb-city-card:nth-child(1),.tb-city-card:nth-child(4){grid-column:1/-1;min-height:340px}\n .tb-city-card a{min-height:340px;padding:25px}\n .tb-city-card:nth-child(1) .tb-city-card__name,.tb-city-card:nth-child(4) .tb-city-card__name{font-size:2.45rem}\n}\n</style>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<section class=\"tb-rooted-hero\">\n <div class=\"tb-shell tb-rooted-hero__inner\">\n  <p class=\"tb-eyebrow\">Rooted In</p>\n  <h1>These Places Raised Me.</h1>\n  <p class=\"tb-rooted-hero__lead\">I was born in Renton, grew up in Issaquah, and over the years I’ve called Renton, Kent, Covington, Maple Valley, Newcastle and Ravensdale home. <strong>These aren’t simply markets I learned. They’re places filled with my own memories.</strong></p>\n </div>\n</section>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<section class=\"tb-story\">\n <div class=\"tb-shell tb-story__grid\">\n  <div>\n   <p class=\"tb-eyebrow\">My corner of the PNW</p>\n   <h2>A lifetime lived right here.</h2>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"tb-story__copy\">\n   <p>I went to school here. Worked my first jobs here. Bought my first home here. Found favorite restaurants here. Made lifelong friends here. Raised my family here.</p>\n   <p>And after 45 years, I still love discovering the stories behind the communities that make this corner of Washington home.</p>\n   <span class=\"tb-story__signature\">These aren’t just places I sell homes. They’re the places that made me.</span>\n  </div>\n </div>\n</section>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<section class=\"tb-places\">\n <div class=\"tb-shell\">\n  <div class=\"tb-places__head\">\n   <div>\n    <p class=\"tb-eyebrow\">The places along the way</p>\n    <h2>My roots run through all of them.</h2>\n   </div>\n   <p class=\"tb-places__intro\">A few moments from a life lived across southeast King County—enough to show why each city feels personal, without turning this into an autobiography.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"tb-timeline\" aria-label=\"Tanya\'s local timeline\">\n   <article class=\"tb-stop\"><span class=\"tb-stop__city\">Renton</span><strong>Where it started.</strong><p>Born here. School, church, family and eventually homeownership brought me back again and again.</p></article>\n   <article class=\"tb-stop\"><span class=\"tb-stop__city\">Issaquah</span><strong>Where I grew up.</strong><p>The Issaquah I remember looked a little different from the one you’ll see today.</p></article>\n   <article class=\"tb-stop\"><span class=\"tb-stop__city\">Newcastle</span><strong>My first real job.</strong><p>Long before Newcastle became today’s city, I was working in Coal Creek country.</p></article>\n   <article class=\"tb-stop\"><span class=\"tb-stop__city\">Ravensdale</span><strong>A house with history.</strong><p>At 18, I lived in a turn-of-the-century family home my stepdad restored.</p></article>\n   <article class=\"tb-stop\"><span class=\"tb-stop__city\">Covington</span><strong>Before the growth.</strong><p>I lived here before much of the shopping and development people associate with Covington today.</p></article>\n   <article class=\"tb-stop\"><span class=\"tb-stop__city\">Maple Valley</span><strong>My first home.</strong><p>This is where I became a homeowner for the first time.</p></article>\n   <article class=\"tb-stop\"><span class=\"tb-stop__city\">Renton</span><strong>Home again.</strong><p>My next two homes brought me back to Renton.</p></article>\n  </div>\n </div>\n</section>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<section class=\"tb-cities\">\n <div class=\"tb-shell\">\n  <div class=\"tb-cities__head\">\n   <p class=\"tb-eyebrow\">Rooted In</p>\n   <h2>Pick a place. I’ll tell you its story.</h2>\n   <p>Start with the cities—their history, personality, everyday rhythm and the things I know from actually living here. We’ll dig into individual neighborhoods next.</p>\n  </div>\n  <ul class=\"tb-city-grid\">\n   <li class=\"tb-city-card tb-city-card--renton\"><a href=\"/renton/\"><span class=\"tb-city-card__label\">Rooted In</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__name\">Renton</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__hook\">My hometown—and still one of my favorite places to talk about.</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__go\">Explore Renton &rarr;</span></a></li>\n   <li class=\"tb-city-card tb-city-card--kent\"><a href=\"/kent/\"><span class=\"tb-city-card__label\">Rooted In</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__name\">Kent</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__hook\">One city with dramatically different personalities, depending on which hill you’re standing on.</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__go\">Explore Kent &rarr;</span></a></li>\n   <li class=\"tb-city-card tb-city-card--covington\"><a href=\"/covington/\"><span class=\"tb-city-card__label\">Rooted In</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__name\">Covington</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__hook\">I remember when there wasn’t much “Covington” in Covington.</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__go\">Explore Covington &rarr;</span></a></li>\n   <li class=\"tb-city-card tb-city-card--maple\"><a href=\"/maple-valley/\"><span class=\"tb-city-card__label\">Rooted In</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__name\">Maple Valley</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__hook\">Where I bought my first home and watched a small community explode with growth.</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__go\">Explore Maple Valley &rarr;</span></a></li>\n   <li class=\"tb-city-card tb-city-card--newcastle\"><a href=\"/newcastle/\"><span class=\"tb-city-card__label\">Rooted In</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__name\">Newcastle</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__hook\">From Coal Creek country to one of the Eastside’s most desirable little cities.</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__go\">Explore Newcastle &rarr;</span></a></li>\n   <li class=\"tb-city-card tb-city-card--ravensdale\"><a href=\"/ravensdale/\"><span class=\"tb-city-card__label\">Rooted In</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__name\">Ravensdale</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__hook\">A little piece of old King County that still feels like one.</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__go\">Explore Ravensdale &rarr;</span></a></li>\n  </ul>\n  <p class=\"tb-rooted-note\">Looking somewhere not listed here? <a href=\"/contact/\">Ask Tanya.</a> I cover the wider Puget Sound area—and I’ll tell you honestly what I know about a place and what I don’t.</p>\n </div>\n</section>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n</main>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"footer\",\"tagName\":\"footer\",\"theme\":\"tanya-barrans\"} /-->', 'page-neighborhoods', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '90246-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-08-26 17:14:36', '2026-08-26 17:14:36', '', 90246, 'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/?p=90388', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(90389, 2, '2026-08-26 17:29:20', '2026-08-26 17:29:20', '<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"header\",\"tagName\":\"header\",\"theme\":\"tanya-barrans\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"main\",\"className\":\"tb-rooted-page\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<main class=\"wp-block-group tb-rooted-page\">\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<style>\n.tb-rooted-page{--navy:#26364a;--blue:#344c6a;--green:#718c78;--rose:#c77798;--cream:#fbf7f0;--white:#fffefa;--ink:#26364a;background:var(--cream);color:var(--ink)}\n.tb-rooted-page *{box-sizing:border-box}\n.tb-shell{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 48px));margin:auto}\n.tb-eyebrow{margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--rose);font-size:.78rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.tb-rooted-hero{position:relative;min-height:660px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(25,39,57,.96) 0%,rgba(38,54,74,.83) 48%,rgba(38,54,74,.34) 100%),url(\'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/i-heart-renton-mural.png\') center/cover no-repeat}\n.tb-rooted-hero:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;right:-80px;bottom:-130px;width:360px;height:360px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.24);border-radius:50%}\n.tb-rooted-hero__inner{position:relative;z-index:1;padding:108px 0 88px}\n.tb-rooted-hero .tb-eyebrow{color:#f0b7ce}\n.tb-rooted-hero h1{max-width:830px;margin:0 0 24px;color:#fff!important;font-family:Georgia,\"Times New Roman\",serif;font-size:clamp(3.5rem,8vw,6.8rem);font-weight:400;line-height:.93;letter-spacing:-.035em}\n.tb-rooted-hero__lead{max-width:700px;margin:0;color:#f7f2ea;font-size:clamp(1.08rem,1.8vw,1.28rem);line-height:1.7}\n.tb-rooted-hero__lead strong{color:#fff}\n.tb-story{padding:108px 0 92px;background:var(--white)}\n.tb-story__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.82fr 1.18fr;gap:9vw;align-items:start}\n.tb-story h2,.tb-places h2,.tb-cities h2{margin:0;font-family:Georgia,\"Times New Roman\",serif;font-size:clamp(2.6rem,5vw,4.6rem);font-weight:400;line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.025em}\n.tb-story__copy{font-size:1.08rem;line-height:1.85;color:#4a5868}\n.tb-story__copy p{margin:0 0 20px}\n.tb-story__signature{display:block;margin-top:30px;padding-left:22px;border-left:3px solid var(--rose);color:var(--navy);font-family:Georgia,\"Times New Roman\",serif;font-size:1.45rem;line-height:1.5}\n.tb-places{padding:96px 0;background:var(--cream)}\n.tb-places__head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:7vw;align-items:end;margin-bottom:52px}\n.tb-places__intro{margin:0;color:#596574;font-size:1.03rem;line-height:1.75}\n.tb-timeline{display:flex;gap:0;overflow-x:auto;padding:18px 0 26px;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory}\n.tb-stop{position:relative;min-width:245px;padding:38px 30px 12px 0;border-top:1px solid #b8c0b8;scroll-snap-align:start}\n.tb-stop:before{content:\"\";position:absolute;top:-7px;left:0;width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--rose);box-shadow:0 0 0 6px var(--cream)}\n.tb-stop__city{display:block;margin-bottom:10px;color:var(--green);font-size:.72rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.tb-stop strong{display:block;margin-bottom:9px;font-family:Georgia,\"Times New Roman\",serif;font-size:1.45rem;font-weight:400;color:var(--navy)}\n.tb-stop p{margin:0;color:#66717e;font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.55}\n.tb-cities{padding:110px 0;background:var(--white)}\n.tb-cities__head{max-width:780px;margin-bottom:52px}\n.tb-cities__head p:last-child{max-width:610px;margin:20px 0 0;color:#5b6775;font-size:1.04rem;line-height:1.7}\n.tb-city-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr);gap:24px;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n.tb-city-card{grid-column:span 4;min-height:390px;border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 18px 45px rgba(38,54,74,.14);transition:transform .22s ease,box-shadow .22s ease}\n.tb-city-card:nth-child(1),.tb-city-card:nth-child(4){grid-column:span 8}\n.tb-city-card a,.tb-city-card__static{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;height:100%;min-height:390px;padding:30px;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;background-position:center;background-size:cover}\n.tb-city-card a:before,.tb-city-card__static:before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(38,54,74,.05),rgba(27,39,55,.94))}\n.tb-city-card a>*,.tb-city-card__static>*{position:relative;z-index:1}\n.tb-city-card:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);box-shadow:0 26px 54px rgba(38,54,74,.2)}\n.tb-city-card--renton a{background-image:url(\'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/i-heart-renton-mural.png\')}\n.tb-city-card--kent a{background-image:url(\'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/kent-green-river-scaled.jpg\')}\n.tb-city-card--covington a{background-image:url(\'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/covington-rainier-scaled.jpg\')}\n.tb-city-card--maple a{background-image:url(\'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/maple-valley-lake-wilderness-scaled.jpg\')}\n.tb-city-card--newcastle a{background-image:url(\'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/newcastle-lake-boren.jpg\')}\n.tb-city-card--ravensdale a{background-image:url(\'https://digitalcollections.lib.washington.edu/digital/api/singleitem/image/wastate/1047/default.jpg\')}\n.tb-city-card__label{align-self:flex-start;margin-bottom:15px;padding:7px 13px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--rose);font-size:.7rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.tb-city-card__name{margin-bottom:10px;font-family:Georgia,\"Times New Roman\",serif;font-size:2.45rem;line-height:1}\n.tb-city-card__hook{max-width:520px;margin-bottom:18px;color:#f7f2ea;font-size:.98rem;line-height:1.55}\n.tb-city-card__go{width:max-content;padding-bottom:4px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--rose);font-weight:750;font-size:.88rem}\n.tb-city-card:nth-child(1) .tb-city-card__name,.tb-city-card:nth-child(4) .tb-city-card__name{font-size:3rem}\n.tb-city-card--issaquah .tb-city-card__static{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;height:100%;min-height:390px;padding:30px;color:#fff;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,#718c78 0%,#344c6a 100%)} .tb-city-card--issaquah .tb-city-card__static:before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(38,54,74,.05),rgba(27,39,55,.72))} .tb-rooted-note{margin-top:52px;padding:30px 0 0;border-top:1px solid #d9d8d1;color:#596574;line-height:1.7}\n.tb-rooted-note a{color:var(--navy);font-weight:800}\n.tb-rooted-hero{min-height:640px;align-items:stretch;background:url(\'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/i-heart-renton-mural.png\') 72% center/cover no-repeat} .tb-rooted-hero:before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0 50% 0 0;width:auto;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:0;background:var(--navy);box-shadow:18px 0 38px rgba(18,31,47,.2)} .tb-rooted-hero:after{display:none}.tb-rooted-hero__inner{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;margin:auto;padding:86px 0}.tb-rooted-hero h1{max-width:530px;font-size:clamp(3.5rem,6vw,5.5rem)}.tb-rooted-hero__lead{max-width:520px;padding-right:44px}\n@media(max-width:900px){\n .tb-story__grid,.tb-places__head{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:34px}\n .tb-city-card,.tb-city-card:nth-child(1),.tb-city-card:nth-child(4){grid-column:span 6}\n}\n@media(max-width:720px){.tb-rooted-hero{min-height:720px;align-items:flex-end;background-position:center top;background-size:auto 310px;background-color:var(--navy)}.tb-rooted-hero:before{inset:290px 0 0;box-shadow:0 -16px 35px rgba(18,31,47,.18)}.tb-rooted-hero__inner{justify-content:flex-end;padding:340px 0 58px}.tb-rooted-hero__lead{padding-right:0}.tb-rooted-hero h1{font-size:clamp(3.1rem,15vw,4.8rem)}}\n@media(max-width:620px){\n .tb-shell{width:min(100% - 36px,1180px)}\n .tb-rooted-hero{min-height:600px}\n .tb-rooted-hero__inner{padding:86px 0 64px}\n .tb-story,.tb-cities{padding:76px 0}.tb-places{padding:72px 0}\n .tb-city-card,.tb-city-card:nth-child(1),.tb-city-card:nth-child(4){grid-column:1/-1;min-height:340px}\n .tb-city-card a{min-height:340px;padding:25px}\n .tb-city-card:nth-child(1) .tb-city-card__name,.tb-city-card:nth-child(4) .tb-city-card__name{font-size:2.45rem}\n}\n</style>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<section class=\"tb-rooted-hero\">\n <div class=\"tb-shell tb-rooted-hero__inner\">\n  <p class=\"tb-eyebrow\">Rooted In</p>\n  <h1>These Places Raised Me.</h1>\n  <p class=\"tb-rooted-hero__lead\">I was born in Renton, grew up in Issaquah, and over the years I’ve called Renton, Kent, Covington, Maple Valley, Newcastle and Ravensdale home. <strong>These aren’t simply markets I learned. They’re places filled with my own memories.</strong></p>\n </div>\n</section>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<section class=\"tb-story\">\n <div class=\"tb-shell tb-story__grid\">\n  <div>\n   <p class=\"tb-eyebrow\">My corner of the PNW</p>\n   <h2>This corner of Washington is personal.</h2>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"tb-story__copy\">\n   <p>I went to school here. Worked my first jobs here. Bought my first home here. Found favorite restaurants here. Made lifelong friends here. Raised my family here.</p>\n   <p>And after 45 years, I still love discovering the stories behind the communities that make this corner of Washington home.</p>\n   <span class=\"tb-story__signature\">These aren’t just places I sell homes. They’re the places that made me.</span>\n  </div>\n </div>\n</section>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<section class=\"tb-places\">\n <div class=\"tb-shell\">\n  <div class=\"tb-places__head\">\n   <div>\n    <p class=\"tb-eyebrow\">The places along the way</p>\n    <h2>A Lifetime Lived Here</h2>\n   </div>\n   <p class=\"tb-places__intro\">From childhood and first jobs to first homes and fresh chapters, these cities aren’t dots on a service-area map. They’re the places that shaped my life.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"tb-timeline\" aria-label=\"Tanya\'s local timeline\">\n   <article class=\"tb-stop\"><span class=\"tb-stop__city\">Renton</span><strong>Where it started.</strong><p>Born in Renton, attended Renton Christian School, and even after moving away, kept coming back for church, youth group, friends and family. Renton has been a constant in my life from the very beginning.</p></article>\n   <article class=\"tb-stop\"><span class=\"tb-stop__city\">Issaquah</span><strong>Where I was raised.</strong><p>I grew up here and graduated from Liberty High School. The drive between Renton and Issaquah looked a whole lot different then — I remember fields where golf courses, neighborhoods and shopping centers eventually appeared. My first real job was just down the road at Coal Creek Chiropractic.</p></article>\n   <article class=\"tb-stop\"><span class=\"tb-stop__city\">Ravensdale</span><strong>A house with history.</strong><p>At 18, I got to call a restored turn-of-the-century family home in Ravensdale home for a year. It gave me a glimpse of this area\'s history long before I ever thought I\'d make a career out of homes.</p></article>\n   <article class=\"tb-stop\"><span class=\"tb-stop__city\">Maple Valley</span><strong>My first front door.</strong><p>This is where I bought my very first home and became a homeowner myself. I\'ve watched Maple Valley grow tremendously since then, but there are still pieces of the community I remember from those earlier days.</p></article>\n   <article class=\"tb-stop\"><span class=\"tb-stop__city\">Kent &amp; Covington</span><strong>My twenty-something years.</strong><p>These cities were home during my early adult years. I knew Kent when a night out looked a little different than it does today, and I lived in Covington before much of what we now think of as “Covington” had even arrived.</p></article>\n   <article class=\"tb-stop\"><span class=\"tb-stop__city\">Renton</span><strong>Coming home.</strong><p>Homeownership eventually brought me back to the city where my story started, this time purchasing my second home here. By then, I knew Renton through a completely different lens.</p></article>\n   <article class=\"tb-stop\"><span class=\"tb-stop__city\">Newcastle</span><strong>Another place to call home.</strong><p>Years after my first job in Coal Creek, life brought me back to Newcastle — this time as a resident. It\'s one of those funny full-circle places in my story: I knew this area before Newcastle looked much like the Newcastle we know today.</p></article>\n   <article class=\"tb-stop\"><span class=\"tb-stop__city\">Renton</span><strong>Rooted.</strong><p>And eventually, home brought me back to Renton once again. I bought a house here for my son and me, and more than five years later, we\'re still here — in the city where my story began.</p></article>\n  </div>\n </div>\n</section></section>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<section class=\"tb-cities\">\n <div class=\"tb-shell\">\n  <div class=\"tb-cities__head\">\n   <p class=\"tb-eyebrow\">Rooted In</p>\n   <h2>Pick a place. I’ll tell you its story.</h2>\n   <p>Start with the cities—their history, personality, everyday rhythm and the things I know from actually living here. We’ll dig into individual neighborhoods next.</p>\n  </div>\n  <ul class=\"tb-city-grid\">\n   <li class=\"tb-city-card tb-city-card--renton\"><a href=\"/renton/\"><span class=\"tb-city-card__label\">Rooted In</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__name\">Renton</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__hook\">My hometown—and still one of my favorite places to talk about.</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__go\">Explore Renton &rarr;</span></a></li>\n   <li class=\"tb-city-card tb-city-card--issaquah\"><div class=\"tb-city-card__static\"><span class=\"tb-city-card__label\">Rooted In</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__name\">Issaquah</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__hook\">The town I grew up in became a city right along with me.</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__go\">Guide coming soon</span></div></li>\n   <li class=\"tb-city-card tb-city-card--kent\"><a href=\"/kent/\"><span class=\"tb-city-card__label\">Rooted In</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__name\">Kent</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__hook\">One city with dramatically different personalities, depending on which hill you’re standing on.</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__go\">Explore Kent &rarr;</span></a></li>\n   <li class=\"tb-city-card tb-city-card--covington\"><a href=\"/covington/\"><span class=\"tb-city-card__label\">Rooted In</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__name\">Covington</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__hook\">I remember when there wasn’t much “Covington” in Covington.</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__go\">Explore Covington &rarr;</span></a></li>\n   <li class=\"tb-city-card tb-city-card--maple\"><a href=\"/maple-valley/\"><span class=\"tb-city-card__label\">Rooted In</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__name\">Maple Valley</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__hook\">Where I bought my first home and watched a small community explode with growth.</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__go\">Explore Maple Valley &rarr;</span></a></li>\n   <li class=\"tb-city-card tb-city-card--newcastle\"><a href=\"/newcastle/\"><span class=\"tb-city-card__label\">Rooted In</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__name\">Newcastle</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__hook\">From Coal Creek country to one of the Eastside’s most desirable little cities.</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__go\">Explore Newcastle &rarr;</span></a></li>\n   <li class=\"tb-city-card tb-city-card--ravensdale\"><a href=\"/ravensdale/\"><span class=\"tb-city-card__label\">Rooted In</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__name\">Ravensdale</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__hook\">A little piece of old King County that still feels like one.</span><span class=\"tb-city-card__go\">Explore Ravensdale &rarr;</span></a></li>\n  </ul>\n  <p class=\"tb-rooted-note\">Looking somewhere not listed here? <a href=\"/contact/\">Ask Tanya.</a> I cover the wider Puget Sound area—and I’ll tell you honestly what I know about a place and what I don’t.</p>\n </div>\n</section>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n</main>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"footer\",\"tagName\":\"footer\",\"theme\":\"tanya-barrans\"} /-->', 'page-neighborhoods', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '90246-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-08-26 17:29:20', '2026-08-26 17:29:20', '', 90246, 'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/?p=90389', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
