>\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover has-custom-content-position\" style=\"padding-top:24px;padding-right:28px;padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:28px;min-height:480px\"><img class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-90406\" alt=\"Covington Community Park\" src=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/covington-park-1.jpeg\" data-object-fit=\"cover\"/><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-40 has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#FCFCF0\"},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"700\"}},\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-large-font-size\" style=\"color:#FCFCF0;font-weight:700\">Covington Community Park</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#FCFCF0\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#FCFCF0\">Sports, recreation, concerts, movies and some of the city\'s biggest summer activities.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"38%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:38%\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"20px\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/covington-park-2-scaled.jpeg\",\"id\":90405,\"alt\":\"Play area at Covington Community Park\",\"dimRatio\":40,\"minHeight\":225,\"minHeightUnit\":\"px\",\"contentPosition\":\"bottom-left\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"24px\",\"bottom\":\"24px\",\"left\":\"28px\",\"right\":\"28px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover has-custom-content-position\" style=\"padding-top:24px;padding-right:28px;padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:28px;min-height:225px\"><img class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-90405\" alt=\"Play area at Covington Community Park\" src=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/covington-park-2-scaled.jpeg\" data-object-fit=\"cover\"/><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-40 has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#FCFCF0\"},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"700\"}},\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-large-font-size\" style=\"color:#FCFCF0;font-weight:700\">Made for community days</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->\n\n<!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/covington-park-3-scaled.jpeg\",\"id\":90404,\"alt\":\"Play structure at Covington Community Park\",\"dimRatio\":40,\"minHeight\":225,\"minHeightUnit\":\"px\",\"contentPosition\":\"bottom-left\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"24px\",\"bottom\":\"24px\",\"left\":\"28px\",\"right\":\"28px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover has-custom-content-position\" style=\"padding-top:24px;padding-right:28px;padding-bottom:24px;padding-left:28px;min-height:225px\"><img class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-90404\" alt=\"Play structure at Covington Community Park\" src=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/covington-park-3-scaled.jpeg\" data-object-fit=\"cover\"/><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-40 has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#FCFCF0\"},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"700\"}},\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-large-font-size\" style=\"color:#FCFCF0;font-weight:700\">Room to move</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"tb-eyebrow\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#E49C00\"}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"tb-eyebrow has-text-color has-small-font-size\" style=\"color:#E49C00\">TRAIL TIME</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#001830\"}},\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-medium-font-size\" style=\"color:#001830\">Jenkins Creek Park</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A wooded local option for trails, quiet walks and a break from pavement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"tb-eyebrow\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#E49C00\"}},\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"tb-eyebrow has-text-color has-small-font-size\" style=\"color:#E49C00\">POOL DAYS</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#001830\"}},\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-medium-font-size\" style=\"color:#001830\">Covington Aquatic Center</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Swim lessons, open swim and summer pool days for the whole family.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"90px\",\"bottom\":\"90px\",\"left\":\"24px\",\"right\":\"24px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"1200px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" style=\"padding-top:90px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:90px;padding-left:24px\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"tb-eyebrow\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#E49C00\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"tb-eyebrow has-text-color\" style=\"color:#E49C00\">THINGS TO DO &amp; ANNUAL EVENTS</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#001830\"},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"700\"}},\"fontSize\":\"xx-large\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-xx-large-font-size\" style=\"color:#001830;font-weight:700\">Somebody is usually planning something.</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Covington may not have 47 places to go on a Saturday night, but the community calendar stays busy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"20px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"top\":{\"color\":\"#001830\",\"width\":\"2px\"}},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"20px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"border-top-color:#001830;border-top-width:2px;padding-top:20px\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#001830\"},\"typography\":{\"textDecoration\":\"underline\"}},\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-medium-font-size\" style=\"color:#001830;text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=Covington+Days+festival\">Covington Days</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>One of the city\'s biggest annual traditions, with a parade, live entertainment, food, vendors, kids\' activities and community events.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"top\":{\"color\":\"#001830\",\"width\":\"2px\"}},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"20px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"border-top-color:#001830;border-top-width:2px;padding-top:20px\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#001830\"},\"typography\":{\"textDecoration\":\"underline\"}},\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-medium-font-size\" style=\"color:#001830;text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=Covington+KidsFest\">KidsFest</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A free annual event at Covington Community Park focused completely on kids, with activities, entertainment and community organizations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"32px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:32px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"top\":{\"color\":\"#001830\",\"width\":\"2px\"}},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"20px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"border-top-color:#001830;border-top-width:2px;padding-top:20px\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#001830\"},\"typography\":{\"textDecoration\":\"underline\"}},\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-medium-font-size\" style=\"color:#001830;text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=Covington+Movies+Under+the+Stars\">Summer concerts &amp; outdoor movies</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Outdoor concerts and Movies Under the Stars take over Covington Community Park during summer. Check the city calendar for current dates.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"top\":{\"color\":\"#001830\",\"width\":\"2px\"}},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"20px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"border-top-color:#001830;border-top-width:2px;padding-top:20px\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#001830\"},\"typography\":{\"textDecoration\":\"underline\"}},\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-medium-font-size\" style=\"color:#001830;text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=Covington+Makers+Market\">Covington Makers Market</a></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Local makers, artists, creators, bakers, crafters and businesses, brought together through the Covington Chamber of Commerce and the City.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\"}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"alabaster\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"900px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-alabaster-background-color has-background\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70)\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"tb-eyebrow\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#E49C00\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"tb-eyebrow has-text-color\" style=\"color:#E49C00\">What\'s coming to Covington</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#001830\"},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"700\"}},\"fontSize\":\"xx-large\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-xx-large-font-size\" style=\"color:#001830;font-weight:700\">LakePointe Urban Village</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you\'ve driven Highway 18 through Covington and wondered, “Are they ever going to do something with that giant gravel pit?”—the answer is yes. Or at least, that\'s the plan.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>LakePointe Urban Village is the massive mixed-use development planned at Covington\'s northern gateway. The approximately 214-acre master-plan area is envisioned to include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Residential neighborhoods</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Commercial and mixed-use development</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Shopping and restaurants</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Public gathering spaces</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Parks and trails</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A central lake/pond feature</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Office space</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Entertainment uses</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The water feature is envisioned as a major public amenity surrounded by places where people can gather, walk, dine, shop and live.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>See the City of Covington\'s official project materials for the detailed plan showing the central water feature, residential and mixed-use areas, gathering spaces, parks, trails and circulation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#637080\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#637080\">Conceptual plans and renderings only. Final development may differ; buildings, roads, restaurants, trails and amenities are not completed or guaranteed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#637080\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#637080\">Plans have historically included entertainment uses and a movie theater concept—but there is no announced theater operator or confirmed opening date. So don\'t start standing in line for movie tickets just yet.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>But if LakePointe ultimately comes together anywhere close to the vision, it could completely change the dining, shopping and entertainment side of Covington.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"flex-start\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#E49C00\",\"text\":\"#001830\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-text-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.covingtonwa.gov/lakepointe/index.php\" style=\"color:#001830;background-color:#E49C00\">View the official LakePointe plan</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:media-text {\"align\":\"full\",\"mediaPosition\":\"right\",\"mediaId\":90400,\"mediaType\":\"image\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignfull has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\"><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"tb-eyebrow\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#E49C00\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"tb-eyebrow has-text-color\" style=\"color:#E49C00\">Shopping, fitness &amp; medical care</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#001830\"},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"700\"}},\"fontSize\":\"xx-large\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-xx-large-font-size\" style=\"color:#001830;font-weight:700\">Life is close to home.</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>One of Covington\'s biggest practical advantages is that everyday errands rarely require a cross-county expedition. Groceries, home projects, fitness, pharmacy runs and medical care are all close by.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Costco gets the punchline, but Covington\'s full collection of big-box stores and daily services is what makes life genuinely convenient.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"flex-start\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#E49C00\",\"text\":\"#001830\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-text-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.multicare.org/location/covington-medical-center/\" style=\"color:#001830;background-color:#E49C00\">Explore MultiCare Covington →</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Costco_Covington_big.jpg\" alt=\"Costco and everyday shopping in Covington, Washington\" class=\"wp-image-90400 size-full\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"900px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70)\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"tb-eyebrow\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#E49C00\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"tb-eyebrow has-text-color\" style=\"color:#E49C00\">Living in Covington</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#001830\"},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"700\"}},\"fontSize\":\"xx-large\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-xx-large-font-size\" style=\"color:#001830;font-weight:700\">The real pros and cons — and what your housing dollar can do here.</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Roads, routines, neighborhoods and the details that matter when you\'re comparing Covington with the rest of South King County—without pretending every place is perfect for every person.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Housing tradeoffs by budget</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Highway 18 and commute patterns</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Daily routines, shopping and amenities</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Who Covington tends to fit best</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Covington offers a pretty broad mix of housing, from established neighborhoods and cul-de-sacs to newer subdivisions, townhomes and brand-new construction.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And one of Covington\'s biggest draws? Your housing dollar can stretch a little further here. Home prices tend to come in below nearby Maple Valley and many parts of Renton, which can mean more square footage, a newer home, a bigger yard or simply more options within your budget.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Of course, \"cheaper\" is relative. Covington is still King County. But if you\'re comparing what $650K, $750K or $850K buys you across Renton, Kent, Maple Valley and Covington, this is where Covington can get really interesting.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Add in Highway 18 access, shopping five minutes away and Maple Valley, Kent and Black Diamond right next door, and the real question becomes: does Covington give you the best combination of house + location for your budget?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"flex-start\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#E49C00\",\"text\":\"#001830\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-text-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/living-in-covington-wa-local-guide/\" style=\"color:#001830;background-color:#E49C00\">Read the full pros &amp; cons guide →</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"800px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"tb-eyebrow\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#E49C00\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"tb-eyebrow has-text-color\" style=\"color:#E49C00\">Current Covington listings</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#001830\"},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"700\"}},\"fontSize\":\"xx-large\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-xx-large-font-size\" style=\"color:#001830;font-weight:700\">See what’s on the market in Covington right now.</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p>Browse current homes for sale in Covington, updated live from the MLS.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"align\":\"center\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#E49C00\",\"text\":\"#001830\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-text-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"https://tanyab.johnlscott.com/search/place/ChIJrZiECBKKkFQRyi9gVKoWY2w\" style=\"color:#001830;background-color:#E49C00\">Explore Covington Homes →</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\"}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"alabaster\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"1200px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-alabaster-background-color has-background\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70)\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"tb-eyebrow\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#E49C00\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"tb-eyebrow has-text-color\" style=\"color:#E49C00\">Keep reading before you start scrolling listings</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#001830\"},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"700\"}},\"fontSize\":\"xx-large\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-xx-large-font-size\" style=\"color:#001830;font-weight:700\">A little more homework, if you want it.</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#001830\"}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#001830\">How to Buy a Home in Renton, WA</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The location is different; the practical buying process and South King County context still travel well.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/how-to-buy-a-home-in-renton-wa/\">Read the article →</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#001830\"}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#001830\">Moving to Renton: A Practical Guide</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Timelines, planning and the unglamorous-but-useful details behind a smoother move.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/moving-to-renton-wa-guide/\">Read the moving guide →</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#001830\"}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#001830\">Best Renton Neighborhoods for Every Lifestyle</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A helpful comparison when Covington, Renton and nearby South King County communities are all on the table.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/best-renton-neighborhoods-for-every-lifestyle-a-locals-honest-guide/\">Compare neighborhoods →</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#001830\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"1200px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-background\" style=\"background-color:#001830;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#FCFCF0\"},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"700\"}},\"fontSize\":\"xx-large\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-xx-large-font-size\" style=\"color:#FCFCF0;font-weight:700\">Keep Exploring South King County</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#FCFCF0\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.1rem\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#FCFCF0;font-size:1.1rem\"><a style=\"color:#FCFCF0\" href=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/rooted-in-kent/\">Rooted in Kent →</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#FCFCF0\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.1rem\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#FCFCF0;font-size:1.1rem\"><a style=\"color:#FCFCF0\" href=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/rooted-in-maple-valley/\">Rooted in Maple Valley →</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#FCFCF0\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.1rem\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#FCFCF0;font-size:1.1rem\"><a style=\"color:#FCFCF0\" href=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/rooted-in-newcastle/\">Rooted in Newcastle →</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#FCFCF0\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.1rem\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#FCFCF0;font-size:1.1rem\"><a style=\"color:#FCFCF0\" href=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/rooted-in-renton/\">Rooted in Renton →</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaId\":90488,\"mediaType\":\"image\",\"mediaWidth\":30,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\"}},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#001830\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile has-background\" style=\"background-color:#001830;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);grid-template-columns:30% auto\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image-2.png\" alt=\"Rooted in Covington badge\" class=\"wp-image-90488 size-full\"/></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#FCFCF0\"},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"700\"}},\"fontSize\":\"xx-large\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-xx-large-font-size\" style=\"color:#FCFCF0;font-weight:700\">Thinking about making Covington home?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#FCFCF0\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#FCFCF0\">Suburban convenience, growing neighborhoods and everything you need close to home.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#FCFCF0\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#FCFCF0\">Whether you\'re moving in, moving across town or comparing South King County communities, Tanya can help you sort through the options without the pressure.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"flex-start\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#E49C00\",\"text\":\"#001830\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-text-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/contact/\" style=\"color:#001830;background-color:#E49C00\">Ask Tanya about Covington</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"footer-rooted\",\"theme\":\"tanya-barrans\",\"tagName\":\"footer\"} /-->', 'Rooted in Covington Page', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '90455-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-08-27 22:24:58', '2026-08-27 22:24:58', '', 90455, 'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/?p=90516', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(90517, 2, '2026-08-27 22:31:10', '2026-08-27 22:31:10', '<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"header\",\"theme\":\"tanya-barrans\",\"tagName\":\"header\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"main\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0rem\",\"bottom\":\"0rem\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"720px\",\"wideSize\":\"1320px\"}} -->\n<main class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:0rem;padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:0rem;padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:post-content {\"align\":\"full\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"720px\",\"wideSize\":\"1320px\"}} /--></main>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"footer\",\"theme\":\"tanya-barrans\",\"tagName\":\"footer\"} /-->', 'Pages', 'Displays a static page unless a custom template has been applied to that page or a dedicated template exists.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'page', '', '', '2026-08-27 22:31:52', '2026-08-27 22:31:52', '', 0, 'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/page/', 0, 'wp_template', '', 0),
(90518, 2, '2026-08-27 22:31:10', '2026-08-27 22:31:10', '<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"clamp(64px,9vw,120px)\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(64px,9vw,120px)\",\"left\":\"24px\",\"right\":\"24px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"820px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" style=\"padding-top:clamp(64px,9vw,120px);padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:clamp(64px,9vw,120px);padding-left:24px\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"clamp(72px,10vw,150px)\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(64px,9vw,130px)\",\"left\":\"clamp(24px,6vw,96px)\",\"right\":\"clamp(24px,6vw,96px)\"}},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#f2eee6\"},\"background\":{\"backgroundImage\":{\"url\":\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Love-Where-You-Live-scaled.png\",\"id\":90509,\"source\":\"file\",\"title\":\"Love Where You Live\"},\"backgroundSize\":\"cover\",\"backgroundPosition\":\"50% 50%\"},\"dimensions\":{\"minHeight\":\"66vw\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"880px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-background\" style=\"background-color:#f2eee6;min-height:66vw;padding-top:clamp(72px,10vw,150px);padding-right:clamp(24px,6vw,96px);padding-bottom:clamp(64px,9vw,130px);padding-left:clamp(24px,6vw,96px)\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(1.25rem,2.1vw,1.55rem)\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.75\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:clamp(1.25rem,2.1vw,1.55rem);line-height:1.75\">I talk about “loving where you live” a lot.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(1.25rem,2.1vw,1.55rem)\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.75\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:clamp(1.25rem,2.1vw,1.55rem);line-height:1.75\">And yes, part of that is loving your neighborhood. Knowing your favorite coffee shop. Having a go-to sushi place. Finding the park your kids love. Knowing the backroad that saves you when traffic is terrible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(1.25rem,2.1vw,1.55rem)\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.75\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:clamp(1.25rem,2.1vw,1.55rem);line-height:1.75\">But that’s only part of it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(1.25rem,2.1vw,1.55rem)\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.75\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:clamp(1.25rem,2.1vw,1.55rem);line-height:1.75\">Because I think loving where you live starts much closer to home.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"56px\",\"bottom\":\"56px\"}}}} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" style=\"margin-top:56px;margin-bottom:56px\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem)\",\"fontWeight\":\"400\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.15\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem);font-weight:400;line-height:1.15\">It’s the life that happens inside.</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.15rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.85\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.85\">It’s the kitchen where you realize somewhere along the way that you actually became a pretty good cook. The counter covered in flour because you decided to learn how to make bread. Baking with your kids—even when half the batter ends up everywhere but the pan.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.15rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.85\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.85\">It’s the garden you planted having absolutely no idea what you were doing, only to discover that growing something brings you a ridiculous amount of joy. The dining room table that has seen homework, holidays, hard conversations, and a thousand completely ordinary Tuesday nights.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.15rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.85\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.85\">It’s finally creating the backyard you always imagined. Painting a wall a color everyone else thinks is crazy. Turning the spare bedroom into something you actually use instead of something you think you’re supposed to have.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#2f3a32\",\"text\":\"#f7f3ec\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"clamp(72px,10vw,140px)\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(72px,10vw,140px)\",\"left\":\"24px\",\"right\":\"24px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"980px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-text-color has-background\" style=\"color:#f7f3ec;background-color:#2f3a32;padding-top:clamp(72px,10vw,140px);padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:clamp(72px,10vw,140px);padding-left:24px\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(2.5rem,6vw,5rem)\",\"fontWeight\":\"400\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.08\",\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"font-size:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,5rem);font-weight:400;line-height:1.08\">A house is the address.<br>Your life is everything around (and inside) it.</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"clamp(64px,9vw,120px)\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(64px,9vw,120px)\",\"left\":\"24px\",\"right\":\"24px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"820px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" style=\"padding-top:clamp(64px,9vw,120px);padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:clamp(64px,9vw,120px);padding-left:24px\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem)\",\"fontWeight\":\"400\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem);font-weight:400\">And sometimes, the way you live changes.</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.15rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.85\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.85\">Maybe the version of you in your twenties wanted to be five minutes from restaurants and nightlife because cooking dinner sounded terrible. And now? You’d rather have a great kitchen, enough room for a garden, a quiet street, and a Costco within reasonable driving distance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.15rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.85\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.85\">Maybe the house that once fit beautifully now needs a home office, a first-floor bedroom, a bigger table, less yard, more yard, or simply a better flow for the people you’ve become.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"56px\",\"bottom\":\"56px\"},\"blockGap\":{\"left\":\"48px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\" style=\"margin-top:56px;margin-bottom:56px\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"500\"}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-weight:500\">Sometimes, it means changing the home.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"lineHeight\":\"1.75\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"line-height:1.75\">Rethinking a room. Tackling the project you’ve put off. Making the space more useful, more comfortable, and more you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"500\"}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-weight:500\">Sometimes, it means moving on.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"lineHeight\":\"1.75\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"line-height:1.75\">Not because you failed to love it, but because it held one chapter well—and you’re ready for the next.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.15rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.85\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.85\">That’s why I don’t think real estate should start with square footage or a list of features. It should start with your real life: what’s working, what isn’t, what you value now, and what you want the next few years to feel like.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.15rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.85\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.85\">My job is to help you see the possibilities clearly—whether that means finding smart ways to love the home you already have, preparing it for what comes next, or finding a place that fits the life you’re growing into.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#f2eee6\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"clamp(64px,8vw,110px)\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(64px,8vw,110px)\",\"left\":\"24px\",\"right\":\"24px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"720px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-background\" style=\"background-color:#f2eee6;padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,110px);padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:clamp(64px,8vw,110px);padding-left:24px\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(1.5rem,3.2vw,2.25rem)\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.55\",\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3.2vw,2.25rem);line-height:1.55\">Because loving where you live isn’t about chasing perfect.<br><strong>It’s about making room for the life that feels like yours.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.15rem\",\"textAlign\":\"center\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"40px\"}}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"margin-top:40px;font-size:1.15rem\"><em>— Tanya</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->', '', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '52-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-08-27 22:31:10', '2026-08-27 22:31:10', '', 52, 'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/?p=90518', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(90519, 2, '2026-08-27 22:31:11', '2026-08-27 22:31:11', '<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"header\",\"theme\":\"tanya-barrans\",\"tagName\":\"header\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"main\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"720px\",\"wideSize\":\"1320px\"}} -->\n<main class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:post-content {\"align\":\"full\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"720px\",\"wideSize\":\"1320px\"}} /--></main>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"footer\",\"theme\":\"tanya-barrans\",\"tagName\":\"footer\"} /-->', 'Pages', 'Displays a static page unless a custom template has been applied to that page or a dedicated template exists.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '90517-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-08-27 22:31:11', '2026-08-27 22:31:11', '', 90517, 'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/?p=90519', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(90520, 2, '2026-08-27 22:31:52', '2026-08-27 22:31:52', '<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"header\",\"theme\":\"tanya-barrans\",\"tagName\":\"header\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"main\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0rem\",\"bottom\":\"0rem\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"720px\",\"wideSize\":\"1320px\"}} -->\n<main class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:0rem;padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:0rem;padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:post-content {\"align\":\"full\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"720px\",\"wideSize\":\"1320px\"}} /--></main>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"footer\",\"theme\":\"tanya-barrans\",\"tagName\":\"footer\"} /-->', 'Pages', 'Displays a static page unless a custom template has been applied to that page or a dedicated template exists.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '90517-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-08-27 22:31:52', '2026-08-27 22:31:52', '', 90517, 'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/?p=90520', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(90522, 2, '2026-08-27 22:45:47', '2026-08-27 22:45:47', '<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"header\",\"theme\":\"tanya-barrans\",\"tagName\":\"header\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"main\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0rem\",\"bottom\":\"0rem\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"720px\",\"wideSize\":\"1320px\"}} -->\n<main class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"margin-top:0px;padding-top:0rem;padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:0rem;padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:post-content {\"align\":\"full\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"720px\",\"wideSize\":\"1320px\"}} /--></main>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"footer\",\"theme\":\"tanya-barrans\",\"tagName\":\"footer\"} /-->', 'Pages', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '90517-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-08-27 22:45:47', '2026-08-27 22:45:47', '', 90517, 'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/?p=90522', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(90523, 2, '2026-08-27 22:46:56', '2026-08-27 22:46:56', '<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0px\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(64px,9vw,120px)\",\"left\":\"24px\",\"right\":\"24px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"820px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" style=\"padding-top:0px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:clamp(64px,9vw,120px);padding-left:24px\"><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"clamp(72px,10vw,150px)\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(64px,9vw,130px)\",\"left\":\"clamp(24px,6vw,96px)\",\"right\":\"clamp(24px,6vw,96px)\"}},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#f2eee6\"},\"background\":{\"backgroundImage\":{\"url\":\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Love-Where-You-Live-scaled.png\",\"id\":90509,\"source\":\"file\",\"title\":\"Love Where You Live\"},\"backgroundSize\":\"cover\",\"backgroundPosition\":\"50% 50%\"},\"dimensions\":{\"minHeight\":\"66vw\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"880px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-background\" style=\"background-color:#f2eee6;min-height:66vw;padding-top:clamp(72px,10vw,150px);padding-right:clamp(24px,6vw,96px);padding-bottom:clamp(64px,9vw,130px);padding-left:clamp(24px,6vw,96px)\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(1.25rem,2.1vw,1.55rem)\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.75\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:clamp(1.25rem,2.1vw,1.55rem);line-height:1.75\">I talk about “loving where you live” a lot.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(1.25rem,2.1vw,1.55rem)\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.75\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:clamp(1.25rem,2.1vw,1.55rem);line-height:1.75\">And yes, part of that is loving your neighborhood. Knowing your favorite coffee shop. Having a go-to sushi place. Finding the park your kids love. Knowing the backroad that saves you when traffic is terrible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(1.25rem,2.1vw,1.55rem)\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.75\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:clamp(1.25rem,2.1vw,1.55rem);line-height:1.75\">But that’s only part of it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(1.25rem,2.1vw,1.55rem)\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.75\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:clamp(1.25rem,2.1vw,1.55rem);line-height:1.75\">Because I think loving where you live starts much closer to home.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"56px\",\"bottom\":\"56px\"}}}} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" style=\"margin-top:56px;margin-bottom:56px\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem)\",\"fontWeight\":\"400\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.15\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem);font-weight:400;line-height:1.15\">It’s the life that happens inside.</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.15rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.85\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.85\">It’s the kitchen where you realize somewhere along the way that you actually became a pretty good cook. The counter covered in flour because you decided to learn how to make bread. Baking with your kids—even when half the batter ends up everywhere but the pan.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.15rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.85\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.85\">It’s the garden you planted having absolutely no idea what you were doing, only to discover that growing something brings you a ridiculous amount of joy. The dining room table that has seen homework, holidays, hard conversations, and a thousand completely ordinary Tuesday nights.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.15rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.85\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.85\">It’s finally creating the backyard you always imagined. Painting a wall a color everyone else thinks is crazy. Turning the spare bedroom into something you actually use instead of something you think you’re supposed to have.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#2f3a32\",\"text\":\"#f7f3ec\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"clamp(72px,10vw,140px)\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(72px,10vw,140px)\",\"left\":\"24px\",\"right\":\"24px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"980px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-text-color has-background\" style=\"color:#f7f3ec;background-color:#2f3a32;padding-top:clamp(72px,10vw,140px);padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:clamp(72px,10vw,140px);padding-left:24px\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(2.5rem,6vw,5rem)\",\"fontWeight\":\"400\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.08\",\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"font-size:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,5rem);font-weight:400;line-height:1.08\">A house is the address.<br>Your life is everything around (and inside) it.</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"clamp(64px,9vw,120px)\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(64px,9vw,120px)\",\"left\":\"24px\",\"right\":\"24px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"820px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" style=\"padding-top:clamp(64px,9vw,120px);padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:clamp(64px,9vw,120px);padding-left:24px\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem)\",\"fontWeight\":\"400\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem);font-weight:400\">And sometimes, the way you live changes.</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.15rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.85\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.85\">Maybe the version of you in your twenties wanted to be five minutes from restaurants and nightlife because cooking dinner sounded terrible. And now? You’d rather have a great kitchen, enough room for a garden, a quiet street, and a Costco within reasonable driving distance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.15rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.85\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.85\">Maybe the house that once fit beautifully now needs a home office, a first-floor bedroom, a bigger table, less yard, more yard, or simply a better flow for the people you’ve become.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"56px\",\"bottom\":\"56px\"},\"blockGap\":{\"left\":\"48px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\" style=\"margin-top:56px;margin-bottom:56px\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"500\"}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-weight:500\">Sometimes, it means changing the home.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"lineHeight\":\"1.75\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"line-height:1.75\">Rethinking a room. Tackling the project you’ve put off. Making the space more useful, more comfortable, and more you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"500\"}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-weight:500\">Sometimes, it means moving on.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"lineHeight\":\"1.75\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"line-height:1.75\">Not because you failed to love it, but because it held one chapter well—and you’re ready for the next.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.15rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.85\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.85\">That’s why I don’t think real estate should start with square footage or a list of features. It should start with your real life: what’s working, what isn’t, what you value now, and what you want the next few years to feel like.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.15rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.85\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.85\">My job is to help you see the possibilities clearly—whether that means finding smart ways to love the home you already have, preparing it for what comes next, or finding a place that fits the life you’re growing into.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#f2eee6\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"clamp(64px,8vw,110px)\",\"bottom\":\"clamp(64px,8vw,110px)\",\"left\":\"24px\",\"right\":\"24px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"720px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-background\" style=\"background-color:#f2eee6;padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,110px);padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:clamp(64px,8vw,110px);padding-left:24px\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(1.5rem,3.2vw,2.25rem)\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.55\",\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3.2vw,2.25rem);line-height:1.55\">Because loving where you live isn’t about chasing perfect.<br><strong>It’s about making room for the life that feels like yours.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.15rem\",\"textAlign\":\"center\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"40px\"}}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"margin-top:40px;font-size:1.15rem\"><em>— Tanya</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->', '', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '52-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-08-27 22:46:56', '2026-08-27 22:46:56', '', 52, 'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/?p=90523', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(90524, 2, '2026-08-28 03:30:16', '2026-08-28 03:30:16', '<!-- wp:html --><style>\n.lw{position:relative;left:50%;width:100vw;margin-left:-50vw;background:#fffdf8;color:#353532;overflow:hidden}.lw *{box-sizing:border-box}.lw img{display:block;width:100%}.lw h1,.lw h2,.lw p{margin-top:0}.lw h2{color:#24364b;font-weight:400}.hero{position:relative;min-height:720px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;background:#24364b}.hero>img{position:absolute;inset:0;height:100%;object-fit:cover;opacity:.84}.hero:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#14202c99,#14202c0a)}.paper{position:relative;z-index:2;width:min(650px,calc(100% - 48px));margin:0 0 -60px clamp(24px,7vw,130px);padding:clamp(38px,5vw,66px);background:#fffdf8;box-shadow:0 22px 60px #0004;border-left:4px solid #d8b4ad;background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(transparent 0,transparent 39px,#66765f20 40px)}.note,.hand,.sign{font-family:\"Bradley Hand\",\"Segoe Print\",\"Comic Sans MS\",cursive;font-style:italic}.note{color:#66765f;font-size:1.2rem}.paper h1{color:#24364b;font-size:clamp(3rem,5.5vw,5.5rem);font-weight:400;line-height:.92}.paper h1 em{display:block;color:#66765f}.hand{font-size:clamp(1.1rem,1.8vw,1.4rem);line-height:1.65}.intro{max-width:820px;margin:auto;padding:130px 24px 85px}.intro p{font-size:clamp(1.25rem,2.2vw,1.6rem);line-height:1.8}.collage{padding-bottom:85px}.collage h2{max-width:1380px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,6vw,100px) 36px;font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.8rem)}.collage img{max-height:820px;object-fit:cover}.caption{max-width:760px;margin:34px auto 0;padding:0 24px;font-size:1.13rem;line-height:1.8}.statement{max-width:1150px;margin:auto;padding:70px 40px 110px}.statement h2{font-size:clamp(2.7rem,5vw,4.8rem);line-height:1.06}.statement em{color:#66765f}.change{position:relative;max-width:1400px;margin:auto;padding-bottom:110px}.change>img{width:70%;height:610px;margin-left:auto;object-fit:cover}.float{position:absolute;left:5%;top:13%;width:min(540px,48%);padding:55px;background:#fffdf8f5;box-shadow:0 18px 48px #24364b22}.float h2,.leave h2{font-size:clamp(2.3rem,4.4vw,4.1rem);line-height:1.04}.float p,.leave p{font-size:1.12rem;line-height:1.8}.kick{font-size:.78rem!important;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#66765f;font-weight:700}.leave{position:relative;min-height:700px;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:70px 6vw}.leave>img,.rooted>img{position:absolute;inset:0;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.leave:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fffdf8 0%,#fffdf8e8 42%,#fffdf820 75%)}.leavecopy{position:relative;z-index:2;width:min(580px,52%)}blockquote{margin:30px 0;padding-left:24px;border-left:3px solid #d8b4ad;color:#66765f;font:clamp(1.4rem,2.4vw,2rem)/1.5 Georgia,serif}.rooted{position:relative;min-height:590px;display:flex;align-items:end;padding:70px 6vw}.rooted:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(0deg,#2d3f31ed,#2d3f3155)}.rootcopy{position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:840px;color:white}.rootcopy h2{color:white;font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.7rem)}.rootcopy p{font-size:1.14rem;line-height:1.8}.close{max-width:900px;margin:auto;padding:85px 24px;text-align:center}.close .lead{font-size:clamp(1.3rem,2.4vw,1.7rem);line-height:1.75}.sign{color:#66765f;font-size:3.4rem}.close h2{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,5vw,4.5rem)}.links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px 30px;justify-content:center}.links a{color:#24364b;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:2px solid #d7a845}@media(max-width:760px){.paper{margin-left:24px}.change>img{width:88%;height:480px}.float{position:relative;left:auto;top:auto;width:calc(100% - 48px);margin:-70px auto 0}.leave{align-items:end}.leave:after{background:linear-gradient(0deg,#fffdf8,#fffdf8dd 58%,transparent)}.leavecopy{width:100%}}\n</style><main class=\"lw\">\n<section class=\"hero\"><img src=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/lwyl-baking-hero.png\" alt=\"Family baking together\"><div class=\"paper\"><p class=\"note\">A note from Tanya</p><h1>Love Where <em>You Live.</em></h1><p class=\"hand\">Not because it’s perfect. Because it’s yours—and because your home should make room for the life you’re actually living.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"intro\"><p>I talk about “loving where you live” a lot.</p><p>And yes, part of that is loving your neighborhood. Knowing your favorite coffee shop. Having a go-to sushi place. Finding the park your kids love. Knowing the backroad that saves you when traffic is terrible.</p><p>But that’s only part of it.</p><p><strong>Because I think loving where you live starts much closer to home.</strong></p></section>\n<section class=\"collage\"><h2>Love looks like…</h2><img src=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/lwyl-love-looks-like-collage.png\" alt=\"Collage of everyday home life\"><p class=\"caption\">The kitchen where you became a pretty good cook. The counter covered in flour. The garden you planted without knowing what you were doing. Homework and holidays at the same table. The backyard dinner that went later than planned.</p></section>\n<section class=\"statement\"><h2>Your home doesn’t have to impress everyone. <em>It needs to work for you.</em></h2></section>\n<section class=\"change\"><img src=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gardening.png\" alt=\"Hands tending a garden\"><div class=\"float\"><p class=\"kick\">One kind of love</p><h2>Sometimes loving where you live means <em>changing it.</em></h2><p>Rethinking a room. Tackling the project you’ve put off. Making space for the people you’ve become.</p><p>The goal isn’t more for the sake of more. It’s a home that supports the way you actually live now.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"leave\"><img src=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/lwyl-moving-on.png\" alt=\"A quiet room ready for a new chapter\"><div class=\"leavecopy\"><p class=\"kick\">Another kind of love</p><h2>Sometimes it means <em>leaving it.</em></h2><p>Not because you failed to love it.</p><blockquote>Sometimes a home did exactly what it was supposed to do. It held one chapter beautifully—and now you’re ready for the next.</blockquote></div></section>\n<section class=\"rooted\"><img src=\"https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Gene-Coulon-Dusk-Docks.png\" alt=\"Gene Coulon Park at dusk\"><div class=\"rootcopy\"><p class=\"kick\" style=\"color:white\">Home expands beyond the front door</p><h2>The people. The places. The little rituals.</h2><p>It’s the coffee shop, the park, the neighbor with the extra ladder, the market, the trail, and the backroad that saves the evening. That’s the heart of <a href=\"/neighborhoods/\"><strong>Rooted</strong></a>.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"close\"><p class=\"lead\">Real estate should start with your real life: what’s working, what isn’t, and what you want the next few years to feel like.</p><p class=\"sign\">— Tanya</p><h2>Where do you want to go next?</h2><nav class=\"links\"><a href=\"/buy/\">Find the next home →</a><a href=\"/sell/\">Talk about moving on →</a><a href=\"/neighborhoods/\">Get Rooted →</a><a href=\"/contact/\">Start a conversation →</a></nav></section>\n</main><!-- /wp:html -->', 'Love Where You Live', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '52-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-08-28 03:30:16', '2026-08-28 03:30:16', '', 52, 'https://violet-wren-104886.hostingersite.com/?p=90524', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
