INSERT INTO `wp_trustindex_google_reviews` (`id`, `hidden`, `user`, `user_photo`, `text`, `rating`, `highlight`, `date`, `reviewId`, `reply`) VALUES
(1, 0, 'Christian Herzberger', 'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLrSdalx724ZsKbF93heqX80M6H-eka-XxAtwROFjz5eAcTXw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100', 'Tanya did an amazing job selling our home. She made sure it was picture ready for getting the maximum possible price for the market. When we ran into snags she went above and beyond to fix them for us. She was available for any questions or concerns we may have had. When it came time to negotiate, she got the best price for us. We can’t thank her enough for all of her hard work and professionalism she exhibited!! You won’t regret going with Tanya and her team!', 5.0, NULL, '2025-03-01', 'ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNRMEpuSUNnEAE', ''),
(2, 0, 'Sarah Curtis', 'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJJ2bZ0vZPJIL6RdlumVsCHuWVYQU0J02Vogd_KQwN-Kyal1A=s120-c-rp-mo-br100', 'When your realtor knows what you want even when you haven’t fully decided! Tanya is fabulous to work with. She anticipated what we were looking for and made our experience memorable in a good way! We’ll never use another realtor.', 5.0, NULL, '2025-01-30', 'ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNBaXVlendRRRAB', ''),
(3, 0, 'Curtis Bell', 'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJElyV0XlDfwLwJ3TJcu5wrqACvyFDK7TzzdovJ3-pr7alJEg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100', 'Tanya is such an amazing person to work with. there was no pressure and she was so knowledgeable about the process. My wife and I will continue to ask for Tanya in any future homes we might buy.', 5.0, NULL, '2024-08-07', 'ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNqaGFtUVN3EAE', ''),
(4, 0, 'B.B. Santiful', 'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW1Pwv_HMCnOD_pSG4HPCJWF9ZBjP3m9RpTTsXekxNedrOptMDo=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100', 'I have had the pleasure of working closely with Tanya on numerous real estate transactions, and I can confidently say that she is an exceptional real estate agent. Tanya is not just a professional; she is a true partner who goes above and beyond for her clients.\n\nTanya\'s dedication to her clients is evident in every interaction. Her attention to detail, market knowledge, and negotiation skills are top-notch. She consistently demonstrates a deep understanding of the real estate industry and always puts her clients\' best interests first.\n\nWhat sets Tanya apart is her unwavering commitment to excellence and her ability to navigate complex transactions with ease. Her communication skills are excellent, and she keeps all parties informed every step of the way, making the process smooth and stress-free for everyone involved.\n\nI highly recommend Tanya to anyone looking to buy or sell real estate. Working with her is a pleasure, and I look forward to continuing our successful partnership in the future.\n\nB.B. Santiful', 5.0, NULL, '2024-05-07', 'ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURqcTdXeEVREAE', ''),
(5, 0, 'Garett Holbrook', 'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW4LfouLKLVZ7qSLRsyZ30t3aafL0Sx5QZC99Ig9ViGYPkD9kg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100', 'Tanya is one of the most diligent Real Estate agents I’ve ever met. She is one of those people that’s not in it for deal but more importantly the relationship.   Each individual she works with is more than just a transaction but a life long friend.   She is amazing at what she does.', 5.0, NULL, '2024-04-29', 'ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNqZzV2X3BRRRAB', 'Thank you so much for your kind words! Building genuine, lasting relationships with my clients is at the heart of what I do as a real estate agent. It\'s not just about the deal; it\'s about ensuring they find the perfect home and making the process as smooth and enjoyable as possible. The fact that so many of my clients become great friends, is an amazing added bonus!'),
(6, 0, 'Kevin Woods', 'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXisrRgRWyuU4DvsYhVWew2Vww85v4yDHmZA2_j7riJIl0brZQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100', 'If you’re looking for someone who is professional, friendly, and truly committed to her clients, Tanya is your go-to. I can’t thank her enough, and I would absolutely recommend her to anyone looking to buy or sell in Renton. Thanks to Tanya, I found my dream home and gained a great new friend in town!', 5.0, NULL, '2024-04-24', 'ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNqdmZHeWdBRRAB', ''),
(7, 0, 'Sasha Bishop', 'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLmv22DQSrxVb-5Z3K6Xi3xHiJ2mexlEsA8i41QKxEXlU5eQC4=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100', 'Ever wish you had a best friend in the real estate biz? Not someone trying to sell ya something, but just someone you could call for advice?!  Well Tanya Barrans is that go-to person!  When I met Tanya I was dealing with some heavy home repair stuff. I wasn’t sure if I should invest money into my current home or sell it. Tanya gave me incredible advice and helped me map out a plan. She is knowledgeable, friendly, savvy, and understands what it’s like to be a home owner. Whether you’re trying to decide on selling your home, interested in seeing what’s out there for buying, or just need some friendly advice about something- call her up! Keep her number handy. She is an awesome ally to have in your back pocket.', 5.0, NULL, '2024-04-24', 'ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNqeGJXbElREAE', 'Thank you for your fantastic review! It was a pleasure to assist you during your home repair decisions. I\'m here not just to guide transactions, but to be a dependable advisor—whether it\'s understanding home repair options, considering whether to buy or sell, or just needing someone to bounce ideas off of. Remember, my goal as your real estate ally is to ensure you feel confident and informed every step of the way. Don\'t hesitate to reach out whenever you need advice; my door is always open! If you or anyone you know is pondering their next steps in real estate, I\'m just a call away.'),
(8, 0, 'Natasha Tomecek', 'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUGse5UXc_89OPVwu9DfYvgDCy-x_F6HK0XdFY6nL2bjFzHCuf4Tg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100', 'We loved working with Tanya! We are first time home buyers with a 5 year old and really needed to get out of renting homes. In a matter of weeks Tanya helped us score a big home with lots of space in a nice neighborhood in Burien. We really appreciated how Tanya went above and beyond to help us during every stage of the process. Another perk is she is so personable, made us feel very comfortable, and she has an awesome sense of humor. 15/10!', 5.0, NULL, '2024-04-16', 'ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNqNFBHUTdBRRAB', 'Awww thank you thank you thank you.... a 15/10?!?! I\'m blushing but very grateful. This made my day!\n\nI absolutely loved working with you and Melissa. After your previous agent experience being less than stellar, it\'s always nerve racking hoping that I can deliver a better outcome for my clients. I was so pleased when we found a home within 2 weeks of looking that was perfect for you two and Noah! (and not a split-level!) \n\nI am so blessed we have all become friends and our boys clicked so well. Speaking of, Asher keeps asking for another hang session. Let\'s do that soon!'),
(9, 0, 'Ryan Maio', 'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXnWg5fv-R1DYKvK8jLN5DcrT2sm7_UdzCXXuCJQ8Zd9JRDvX5YHQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100', 'Tanya is a fantastic realtor! She knows the market, especially in the greater Renton area, and is overall a pleasure to work with!', 5.0, NULL, '2023-09-20', 'ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNDOVAtLUFnEAE', 'Thank you for leaving me a 5-star review! I truly appreciate your support and trust as your real estate agent in Renton, WA. Your satisfaction is my top priority, and I\'m thrilled to have met your expectations. If you or anyone you know is in need of real estate services in Renton, WA, please don\'t hesitate to reach out. I\'m here to assist with all your property needs. Thank you again for the positive review!'),
(10, 0, 'Monica Young', 'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVxvltCaPs5l2CgbZ69r97cz_hzcReHak2GBchIjl_wG9F4sl85=s120-c-rp-mo-br100', 'Tanya is great! Extremely professional, knowledgeable and understanding! I love her monthly magazine with home owner tips! She is very attentive and doesn’t leave you hanging in the wind for answers. The process can be confusing and overwhelming but Tanya explains every step. She makes the whole experience easy and feels more like a friend than a real estate agent. I would recommend Tanya to anyone in the market to sell or buy a home. My selling process was seamless because of Tanya! She also had an awesome celebration for my signing…with cake!! She literally went the extra mile every step of the way.', 5.0, NULL, '2023-09-19', 'ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMycDYzLWt3RRAB', 'I\'m truly grateful for your kind words. Your satisfaction and trust mean a lot to me. I\'m happy to hear that you found my service professional and attentive. Navigating real estate can be confusing, but I\'m here to simplify the process for you.\n\nThank you for recommending me to others. Your support is invaluable.\n\nI\'m thrilled you enjoyed the signing celebration – celebrations are an important part of this journey and I have to say, that one was a blast!\n\nI look forward to helping you and Morgan again in the future. You truly are one of the best clients and it was my honor to help you both!!');
